(3599231, 501740, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the editing but I''m afraid many of the purists will see it as too much digital manipulation.  I''m anxious to hear the story about this guy.  He has a wonderful face. I particularly like his hands.  That bit of "hot" on his left hand (to our right) might need a smidge of work, but otherwise, I like it.</td>', 'I like the editing but I''m afraid many of the purists will see it as too much digital manipulation.  I''m anxious to hear the story about this guy.  He has a wonderful face. I particularly like his hands.  That bit of "hot" on his left hand (to our right) might need a smidge of work, but otherwise, I like it.', '2007-05-01 10:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
