(3599238, 502252, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the sky and birds.  The lighting seems a touch harsh. The pop of pink from her shirt is a nice compliment to the otherwise neutral and cool tones. This would be an interesting study in black and white as well. 6</td>', 'Love the sky and birds.  The lighting seems a touch harsh. The pop of pink from her shirt is a nice compliment to the otherwise neutral and cool tones. This would be an interesting study in black and white as well. 6', '2007-05-01 10:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
