(3599246, 500424, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wonderful night shot. I wonder though, if you''d adjusted your POV a bit to eliminate more of the road. Hmmmm Great colors and the focus is terrific for a long exposure. Love the clouds and that pop of turquoise right over the bridge. It seems to have a slight tilt, but it might be an optikal illusion because the road is wider on the left than on the right.  No points off for that.</td>', 'Wonderful night shot. I wonder though, if you''d adjusted your POV a bit to eliminate more of the road. Hmmmm Great colors and the focus is terrific for a long exposure. Love the clouds and that pop of turquoise right over the bridge. It seems to have a slight tilt, but it might be an optikal illusion because the road is wider on the left than on the right.  No points off for that.', '2007-05-01 10:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599248, 501721, 75898, '<td valign="top">What a great capture!  But IMO there''s too much noise/grain.  Other than that, its WONDERFUL!</td>', 'What a great capture!  But IMO there''s too much noise/grain.  Other than that, its WONDERFUL!', '2007-05-01 10:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599255, 505630, 75898, '<td valign="top">The stormy sky really adds to the old feeling.  Nice PP.</td>', 'The stormy sky really adds to the old feeling.  Nice PP.', '2007-05-01 10:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599257, 505480, 74559, '<td valign="top">Love the saturated colors!</td>', 'Love the saturated colors!', '2007-05-01 10:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599258, 505362, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW - terrific focus and detail. The darker reds seem to be maybe oversaturated or something because I can see distinct lines around them, instead of the blur of the pink and yellow. Other than that, I like it. If it were mine, I''d probably crop out most of the lower area and make it a landscape instead of portrait orientation, which would eliminate the big spot on the bottom. You could probaby use the blur or smudge tool to the one on the right, using expert editing.</td>', 'WOW - terrific focus and detail. The darker reds seem to be maybe oversaturated or something because I can see distinct lines around them, instead of the blur of the pink and yellow. Other than that, I like it. If it were mine, I''d probably crop out most of the lower area and make it a landscape instead of portrait orientation, which would eliminate the big spot on the bottom. You could probaby use the blur or smudge tool to the one on the right, using expert editing.', '2007-05-01 10:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599261, 505689, 15711, '<td valign="top">Terrific bokeh.  I wish the focus on the bug were tack sharp. It seems just slightly OOF. Love the stripe of his antennae.</td>', 'Terrific bokeh.  I wish the focus on the bug were tack sharp. It seems just slightly OOF. Love the stripe of his antennae.', '2007-05-01 10:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599264, 504762, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think this would be GREAT done in a sepia duotone. For me, the POW of color against the black and white loses the nostalgic touch, particularly with the title. I like the composition.</td>', 'I think this would be GREAT done in a sepia duotone. For me, the POW of color against the black and white loses the nostalgic touch, particularly with the title. I like the composition.', '2007-05-01 10:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
