(3599329, 505255, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very cool. I love the contre jour. All of the continuity of the statues adds to the shape of the monk.  The complementary green/red works well with the pop of gold. Nice light and shadow play too. Maybe clone out that "blob" in the lower left corner.</td>', 'Very cool. I love the contre jour. All of the continuity of the statues adds to the shape of the monk.  The complementary green/red works well with the pop of gold. Nice light and shadow play too. Maybe clone out that "blob" in the lower left corner.', '2007-05-01 10:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
