(3599336, 500513, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the pink and the focus on the flower, but the rest kind of leaves me "eh." The DOF is good though. What if you did a curves adjustment to really enrich the background, making it much darker, and then the flower would even be more prominent? The gray just isn''t working for me. Hmmm thinking out loud.</td>', 'I love the pink and the focus on the flower, but the rest kind of leaves me "eh." The DOF is good though. What if you did a curves adjustment to really enrich the background, making it much darker, and then the flower would even be more prominent? The gray just isn''t working for me. Hmmm thinking out loud.', '2007-05-01 10:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599346, 503925, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh this is delicious.  The title - wow - perfect.  The intensity of the eye, and the chin whiskers and mane.  Going to straight to favs.  10 from me.</td>', 'Oh this is delicious.  The title - wow - perfect.  The intensity of the eye, and the chin whiskers and mane.  Going to straight to favs.  10 from me.', '2007-05-01 10:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
