(3599349, 505710, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful. The line of the tree crossing diagonally across the frame  is stunning, given the rich coppery tones of the trunk. I love the warm/cool color scheme. I wonder what it would look like if you adjusted curves? Hmmm maybe too dark, but I''d try it for fun. Ain''t mother nature grand??</td>', 'Really beautiful. The line of the tree crossing diagonally across the frame  is stunning, given the rich coppery tones of the trunk. I love the warm/cool color scheme. I wonder what it would look like if you adjusted curves? Hmmm maybe too dark, but I''d try it for fun. Ain''t mother nature grand??', '2007-05-01 10:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599352, 505595, 15711, '<td valign="top">She looks pretty ho hum to be about to get married. LOL I like the slight tilt - maybe saying something about the state of marriage today. But honestly, I''d crop out the wicker settee on the left and either make it a square crop, or in the portrait orientation, leaving the tilt of the railing. I hope she''s happy.</td>', 'She looks pretty ho hum to be about to get married. LOL I like the slight tilt - maybe saying something about the state of marriage today. But honestly, I''d crop out the wicker settee on the left and either make it a square crop, or in the portrait orientation, leaving the tilt of the railing. I hope she''s happy.', '2007-05-01 10:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599354, 504935, 15711, '<td valign="top">"Up in Smoke" immediately came to mind for some reason. Maybe the dude on the right and the lifters on the car. LOL</td>', '"Up in Smoke" immediately came to mind for some reason. Maybe the dude on the right and the lifters on the car. LOL', '2007-05-01 10:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599358, 505639, 75898, '<td valign="top">I love the reflections!  Nice colors too!</td>', 'I love the reflections!  Nice colors too!', '2007-05-01 10:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599359, 503866, 32767, '<td valign="top">I''m curious what you did here. Lensbaby or additional blurring??? Doesn''t rest well with my eye. Good Luck.</td>', 'I''m curious what you did here. Lensbaby or additional blurring??? Doesn''t rest well with my eye. Good Luck.', '2007-05-01 10:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599361, 505733, 32767, '<td valign="top">Nice work. Tough bird to capture. It''s whites are a nightmare. Good Luck.</td>', 'Nice work. Tough bird to capture. It''s whites are a nightmare. Good Luck.', '2007-05-01 10:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599363, 503939, 32767, '<td valign="top">Jeeez ...this made me stand up immediately and salute. Good Luck.</td>', 'Jeeez ...this made me stand up immediately and salute. Good Luck.', '2007-05-01 10:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599367, 500532, 75898, '<td valign="top">I am very curious as to what this is.</td>', 'I am very curious as to what this is.', '2007-05-01 10:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599368, 503597, 31403, '<td valign="top">this photo has no real subject - the only thing that draws my eye is the yellow blossom - and it seems fuzzy, and is such a small percentage of the image <br/> <br/>The view point also seems rather ordinary - as though you walked up, pointed your camera down, and snapped the shot.<br/> <br/>The final observation is there are no compositional hints as to where my eye should go - I find my eye just wandering around the frame.<br/> <br/>I think your eye was drawn to the yellow blossom - I would suggest that you work to show us this common image in an uncommon way - wait for more indirect sunlight?  Use a bounce card to fill in the harsh shadows?  But definitely fill your frame with the blossom.  Then I think you''ll see your scores will be higher.<br/> <br/>Hope that helps.</td>', 'this photo has no real subject - the only thing that draws my eye is the yellow blossom - and it seems fuzzy, and is such a small percentage of the image  The view point also seems rather ordinary - as though you walked up, pointed your camera down, and snapped the shot. The final observation is there are no compositional hints as to where my eye should go - I find my eye just wandering around the frame. I think your eye was drawn to the yellow blossom - I would suggest that you work to show us this common image in an uncommon way - wait for more indirect sunlight?  Use a bounce card to fill in the harsh shadows?  But definitely fill your frame with the blossom.  Then I think you''ll see your scores will be higher. Hope that helps.', '2007-05-01 10:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599369, 505352, 75898, '<td valign="top">For Two!</td>', 'For Two!', '2007-05-01 10:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
