(3600007, 504045, 60698, '<td valign="top">Weird! Nice capture! Great eye and imagination. The arches are interesting, but try cropping the top off this photo just a little above the first sunbeam. It brings more attention to your subjects.</td>', 'Weird! Nice capture! Great eye and imagination. The arches are interesting, but try cropping the top off this photo just a little above the first sunbeam. It brings more attention to your subjects.', '2007-05-01 14:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
