(3600028, 503876, 10867, '<td valign="top">Lovely, timeless portrait of a very appealing child with very nice DA work.  However, I think the image would be even more effective if you cropped just a bit off the top--maybe 1/2 and inch (1cm).</td>', 'Lovely, timeless portrait of a very appealing child with very nice DA work.  However, I think the image would be even more effective if you cropped just a bit off the top--maybe 1/2 and inch (1cm).', '2007-05-01 14:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
