(3600423, 504638, 70369, '<td valign="top">I think this would be really clean if you cropped it all the way to the outside edge of the outside window lines on each side.. Then you''d get rid of whatever the reflection is that''s showing..Since, it doesn''t seem to be the capital at that point. IMHO. This is a 7 for me. Nice job..</td>', 'I think this would be really clean if you cropped it all the way to the outside edge of the outside window lines on each side.. Then you''d get rid of whatever the reflection is that''s showing..Since, it doesn''t seem to be the capital at that point. IMHO. This is a 7 for me. Nice job..', '2007-05-01 15:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600438, 505120, 30049, '<td valign="top">The doormat is not centered.  :)  Just had to give you a hard time.  He-he.  Nice symmetry here.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The doormat is not centered.  :)  Just had to give you a hard time.  He-he.  Nice symmetry here.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-05-01 15:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
