(3600453, 495453, 70369, '<td valign="top">... not sure !!! I''m thinking I would have liked to see this in color.. There''s not a lot of balance between the dark shades &amp; the bright ones.. Maybe a little play with curves or contrast would give it more depth.</td>', '... not sure !!! I''m thinking I would have liked to see this in color.. There''s not a lot of balance between the dark shades & the bright ones.. Maybe a little play with curves or contrast would give it more depth.', '2007-05-01 15:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600463, 499218, 70369, '<td valign="top">The background is a bit distracting.. Next time, try a larger aperature to blur some of that out.. Then all the focus is solely on your subject.</td>', 'The background is a bit distracting.. Next time, try a larger aperature to blur some of that out.. Then all the focus is solely on your subject.', '2007-05-01 15:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600467, 498635, 55956, '<td valign="top">great. 10.</td>', 'great. 10.', '2007-05-01 15:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600478, 504124, 70369, '<td valign="top">Looks like a flash was used here... The foreground seems much to bright to fit in with the background. Looks like a gorgeous place to shoot though. Maybe try shooting a tad bit earlier in the day &amp; using a longer exposure. IMHO.</td>', 'Looks like a flash was used here... The foreground seems much to bright to fit in with the background. Looks like a gorgeous place to shoot though. Maybe try shooting a tad bit earlier in the day & using a longer exposure. IMHO.', '2007-05-01 15:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600483, 498589, 64929, '<td valign="top">Great...but is it a photograph??  Looks more like a cartoon, painting, etc.  Kinda breeches the lines between photography and digital art, IMHO.  But very cool, nonetheless!</td>', 'Great...but is it a photograph??  Looks more like a cartoon, painting, etc.  Kinda breeches the lines between photography and digital art, IMHO.  But very cool, nonetheless!', '2007-05-01 15:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
