(3600485, 505666, 70369, '<td valign="top">I love the catch lights in her eyes &amp; the wind blown hair. This is very pretty &amp; lit perfectly. IMHO</td>', 'I love the catch lights in her eyes & the wind blown hair. This is very pretty & lit perfectly. IMHO', '2007-05-01 15:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
