(3600493, 497050, 30049, '<td valign="top">I think the seagull would be more of a silhouette if it was really part of this image at the time of capture.  Nice job of exposing the light in the water reflections.</td>', 'I think the seagull would be more of a silhouette if it was really part of this image at the time of capture.  Nice job of exposing the light in the water reflections.', '2007-05-01 15:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600500, 505548, 70369, '<td valign="top">I wonder what this looks like in color. Doing it in black &amp; white is fine, except I like to see not only really bright white, but also, very dark areas too. There''s a lot of gray colors. Maybe a bit more contrast and that would really make it "pop".</td>', 'I wonder what this looks like in color. Doing it in black & white is fine, except I like to see not only really bright white, but also, very dark areas too. There''s a lot of gray colors. Maybe a bit more contrast and that would really make it "pop".', '2007-05-01 15:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
