(3600709, 500948, 66952, '<td valign="top">The composition is interesting, and I like the deep rich colors and detail on the trees....but...the moon and stars look really unreal, Real starfields have a lot more variety. Yours are all the same size and intensity. And there''s a huge bright moon directly in front of the camera, but all the moonlight is hitting the trees from the right.</td>', 'The composition is interesting, and I like the deep rich colors and detail on the trees....but...the moon and stars look really unreal, Real starfields have a lot more variety. Yours are all the same size and intensity. And there''s a huge bright moon directly in front of the camera, but all the moonlight is hitting the trees from the right.', '2007-05-01 16:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
