(3601199, 496886, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is why I loathe the expert editiing rule, because photography involves respect for the moment as well as the result  and it''s easy to be fooled. If this is a single capture I would rate this a 10 for beauty of composition, texture, dynamism and interest. If it''s a comp then considerably less because it''s just so pointless otherwise.<br/> <br/>I see no evidence of comping so I''ll go for the top marks. Beautiful (and I hope I''m not being made to feel stoopid!).</td>', 'This is why I loathe the expert editiing rule, because photography involves respect for the moment as well as the result  and it''s easy to be fooled. If this is a single capture I would rate this a 10 for beauty of composition, texture, dynamism and interest. If it''s a comp then considerably less because it''s just so pointless otherwise. I see no evidence of comping so I''ll go for the top marks. Beautiful (and I hope I''m not being made to feel stoopid!).', '2007-05-01 17:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
