(3601225, 501691, 8860, '<td valign="top">Were it not for the super-smoothing this would be a very good portrait. As it is it''s still nice but you''ve lost all sense of photography through the use of a silky filter. Grain is sometimes good and adds to the atmosphere and sense of realism.</td>', 'Were it not for the super-smoothing this would be a very good portrait. As it is it''s still nice but you''ve lost all sense of photography through the use of a silky filter. Grain is sometimes good and adds to the atmosphere and sense of realism.', '2007-05-01 17:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
