(3601240, 502538, 67844, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. I have two suggestions though 1) the vertical post or tree in the background is off angle and distracts me, and 2) it appears as though you blurred select leaves for effect but they look out of place next to leaves that are not as blurred. Maybe it is just a trick of the eye due to the compression of a long lens.</td>', 'Nice photo. I have two suggestions though 1) the vertical post or tree in the background is off angle and distracts me, and 2) it appears as though you blurred select leaves for effect but they look out of place next to leaves that are not as blurred. Maybe it is just a trick of the eye due to the compression of a long lens.', '2007-05-01 17:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3601242, 505539, 33352, '<td valign="top">good composition, IMHO would not have burnt the top left...5</td>', 'good composition, IMHO would not have burnt the top left...5', '2007-05-01 17:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
