(3604100, 503369, 67258, '<td valign="top">Well composed with the foreground and then the curve of the bay leading the eye around the picture. The light does seem very harsh, and I suspect you may have produced a stronger photo earlier or later in the day.</td>', 'Well composed with the foreground and then the curve of the bay leading the eye around the picture. The light does seem very harsh, and I suspect you may have produced a stronger photo earlier or later in the day.', '2007-05-02 03:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3604239, 505669, 22301, '<td valign="top">Hey I think I know who this is!!! It looks like you did a great job getting a good shutterspeed and wide enough to get a bunch of the scene involved withour any distortion. Can''t wait to see the details. The mountain in the background is a nice touch too.</td>', 'Hey I think I know who this is!!! It looks like you did a great job getting a good shutterspeed and wide enough to get a bunch of the scene involved withour any distortion. Can''t wait to see the details. The mountain in the background is a nice touch too.', '2007-05-02 04:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3604245, 505701, 22301, '<td valign="top">Very good lighting on the subject, I don;t know if you added the background in Post or if it is an actual background, but I wish it was more OoF, as it takes attention a way from the model. If it is an actual background, try setting up your model a few feet away from the backdrop.<br/>good luck<br/>Joe</td>', 'Very good lighting on the subject, I don;t know if you added the background in Post or if it is an actual background, but I wish it was more OoF, as it takes attention a way from the model. If it is an actual background, try setting up your model a few feet away from the backdrop.good luckJoe', '2007-05-02 04:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3604259, 503982, 22301, '<td valign="top">I think if you would have moved over a few steps to the right the image would have a better presentation as I find the sun dial blocking th subject of your image distracting. The other technicals like color, contrast, etc are all very good.</td>', 'I think if you would have moved over a few steps to the right the image would have a better presentation as I find the sun dial blocking th subject of your image distracting. The other technicals like color, contrast, etc are all very good.', '2007-05-02 04:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3604343, 498879, 74823, '<td valign="top">I like how dark it is, but the whites are lacking a little punch and it makes the image a bit flat. Otherwise a very nice photo. Sinister.</td>', 'I like how dark it is, but the whites are lacking a little punch and it makes the image a bit flat. Otherwise a very nice photo. Sinister.', '2007-05-02 05:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
