(3604392, 496664, 31307, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a much closer shot where the tattoo and only part of the thong are visible would have been better?</td>', 'Perhaps a much closer shot where the tattoo and only part of the thong are visible would have been better?', '2007-05-02 06:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
