(3604426, 501944, 31307, '<td valign="top">I am not a fan of excessive post-processing that tries to simulate a different artistic medium.  This is a photography contest.  Interesting use of photoshop filters, though, so kudos on that.</td>', 'I am not a fan of excessive post-processing that tries to simulate a different artistic medium.  This is a photography contest.  Interesting use of photoshop filters, though, so kudos on that.', '2007-05-02 06:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
