(3604575, 503499, 77192, '<td valign="top">Hehe very clever.</td>', 'Hehe very clever.', '2007-05-02 08:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3604603, 500041, 38032, '<td valign="top">Holy scary. This is wonderful and I always wonder whether people are like me and the idea developes during the project almost as much as beforehand - no pun intended.   This has to be the most artistic piece I''ve seen in a while.  The rich background makes this so complex but it all seems confident and intentional.  The obvious symbolism and appropriate emotion on the face tell the story well.  I love the hot hellish vibe and i would be wrong to give this anything below an 8.  The only thing I might have changed was bringing the subject out a bit more from the background.  I gonna guess you get 72 comments on this during voting and 51 of them will be positive. 8</td>', 'Holy scary. This is wonderful and I always wonder whether people are like me and the idea developes during the project almost as much as beforehand - no pun intended.   This has to be the most artistic piece I''ve seen in a while.  The rich background makes this so complex but it all seems confident and intentional.  The obvious symbolism and appropriate emotion on the face tell the story well.  I love the hot hellish vibe and i would be wrong to give this anything below an 8.  The only thing I might have changed was bringing the subject out a bit more from the background.  I gonna guess you get 72 comments on this during voting and 51 of them will be positive. 8', '2007-05-02 08:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3604623, 501997, 21500, '<td valign="top">I love it - great colors and emotions.  It seems like there might be a little bit of ghosting around the trees - was it in focus or pp sharpened?  <br/>I would hang this on my wall.</td>', 'I love it - great colors and emotions.  It seems like there might be a little bit of ghosting around the trees - was it in focus or pp sharpened?  I would hang this on my wall.', '2007-05-02 08:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3604705, 505022, 67834, '<td valign="top">haha i like the comical side to this image and the great contrast between the sky and the green of the corn shoots really makes this stand out. <br/>However, the fact the sky fades out to white makes it look rather unnatural and makes me wonder if this sky has been added on and blended in photoshop? So for that alone I can''t score this as highly as I may have done had it looked more natural.  <br/> <br/>Great composition and IMO the positioning of the tractor is spot on. The straw in the mouth shows you have thought about attention to detail and is a nice touch.</td>', 'haha i like the comical side to this image and the great contrast between the sky and the green of the corn shoots really makes this stand out. However, the fact the sky fades out to white makes it look rather unnatural and makes me wonder if this sky has been added on and blended in photoshop? So for that alone I can''t score this as highly as I may have done had it looked more natural.   Great composition and IMO the positioning of the tractor is spot on. The straw in the mouth shows you have thought about attention to detail and is a nice touch.', '2007-05-02 08:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3604804, 494483, 67301, '<td valign="top">I really think that the sharpening is too much but at the same time it works with this shot. 7</td>', 'I really think that the sharpening is too much but at the same time it works with this shot. 7', '2007-05-02 09:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3604809, 505712, 67834, '<td valign="top">hmmmm this is a pretty unusual perspective and I can''t decided whether I like it or not. <br/>One thing I noticed straight away was the amount of "noise" normally caused by using a high ISO setting but as this image is very artistic and unusual i''m not sure if it was intentional or not. <br/>The ground looks too blown out IMO especially on the right hand side at the front but again i''m not sure if this is intentional or not? <br/>The crop is kinda strange too and you''ve definitely got me wanting to see more, and I guess that can only be a good thing....</td>', 'hmmmm this is a pretty unusual perspective and I can''t decided whether I like it or not. One thing I noticed straight away was the amount of "noise" normally caused by using a high ISO setting but as this image is very artistic and unusual i''m not sure if it was intentional or not. The ground looks too blown out IMO especially on the right hand side at the front but again i''m not sure if this is intentional or not? The crop is kinda strange too and you''ve definitely got me wanting to see more, and I guess that can only be a good thing....', '2007-05-02 09:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
