(3605222, 495453, 31403, '<td valign="top">Why black and white?  Use shadow/highlights to add some detail to that very dark hand - and in a Free Study - always clean up your sensor schmutz.</td>', 'Why black and white?  Use shadow/highlights to add some detail to that very dark hand - and in a Free Study - always clean up your sensor schmutz.', '2007-05-02 11:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
