(3605252, 497194, 31403, '<td valign="top">Poker?  I don''t understand that.<br/> <br/>Would prefer the building be rectilinear - it''s tipping back right now - <br/> <br/>And ducks?  And a flower?  What''s that got to do with Paris?<br/> <br/>The tower image is stunning - and so diluted by the other three images it''s just lost.<br/> <br/>Better bet to show us something we''ve seen before in a new way - like the tower.  I think you would have scored much higher with just that amazing image. <br/> <br/>Would love to see more detail of the metal work in that image too.  Shadow/highlight or dodging that dark section would bring out more of the detail that is just peaking at us now.</td>', 'Poker?  I don''t understand that. Would prefer the building be rectilinear - it''s tipping back right now -  And ducks?  And a flower?  What''s that got to do with Paris? The tower image is stunning - and so diluted by the other three images it''s just lost. Better bet to show us something we''ve seen before in a new way - like the tower.  I think you would have scored much higher with just that amazing image.  Would love to see more detail of the metal work in that image too.  Shadow/highlight or dodging that dark section would bring out more of the detail that is just peaking at us now.', '2007-05-02 11:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
