(3605262, 503519, 58452, '<td valign="top">I like these type images.  Shift you viewpoint a little next time so the road is exactly centered.</td>', 'I like these type images.  Shift you viewpoint a little next time so the road is exactly centered.', '2007-05-02 11:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3605265, 505087, 31403, '<td valign="top">needs to be brighter - the whites aren''t all the way white<br/>Don''t be shy about boosting that saturation - it is a free study and you''re competing against very processed images<br/>Burning the flower darks nice and lightly and then a quick over with the dodge of the midtones and highlights would add some contrast to the yellow section too.<br/>then maybe a quick run through a noise reduction software and you''re there!<br/> <br/>It''s a nice shot, it just needs some love to stand out in this crowd.  Hope that''s helpful.</td>', 'needs to be brighter - the whites aren''t all the way whiteDon''t be shy about boosting that saturation - it is a free study and you''re competing against very processed imagesBurning the flower darks nice and lightly and then a quick over with the dodge of the midtones and highlights would add some contrast to the yellow section too.then maybe a quick run through a noise reduction software and you''re there! It''s a nice shot, it just needs some love to stand out in this crowd.  Hope that''s helpful.', '2007-05-02 11:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3605275, 494785, 58452, '<td valign="top">I like the pose and the color combos in this image.  The bokeh is beautiful.  With expert editing I''d be temped to clone out the OOF trunk that enters the animals butt and exits the head, were it my image.  Alas, it is not.  ;)</td>', 'I like the pose and the color combos in this image.  The bokeh is beautiful.  With expert editing I''d be temped to clone out the OOF trunk that enters the animals butt and exits the head, were it my image.  Alas, it is not.  ;)', '2007-05-02 11:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3605284, 496747, 31403, '<td valign="top">a single light source would have much deeper shadows, I''m sure it came from the camera almost a silhouette - this feels very artificial because the shadows are gone!  Feels too HDR - <br/> <br/>I would have removed the tourist placard that is reflecting there in the middle - it''s kind of distracting.</td>', 'a single light source would have much deeper shadows, I''m sure it came from the camera almost a silhouette - this feels very artificial because the shadows are gone!  Feels too HDR -  I would have removed the tourist placard that is reflecting there in the middle - it''s kind of distracting.', '2007-05-02 11:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
