(3605914, 505238, 30049, '<td valign="top">Chris, I think it was very unethical for you to use this photo in this challenge considering you posted it in  <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=585483" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this thread</a> asking for feedback 2 days before the challenge went into the voting stage.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=504480" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/67834/thumb/504480.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/67834/thumb/504480.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/67834/thumb/504480.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Chris, I think it was very unethical for you to use this photo in this challenge considering you posted it in  this thread asking for feedback 2 days before the challenge went into the voting stage. ', '2007-05-02 13:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3605923, 503204, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice closeup that fills the frame.  Seems a little oversharpened and a bit overexposed IMO.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice closeup that fills the frame.  Seems a little oversharpened and a bit overexposed IMO.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-05-02 13:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3605944, 491273, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a very unique piece of architecture and has shown up frequently here at DPC.  That''s all fine, but unfortunately, it''s been done a little better in the past than this one.  If you are going to revisit a location that''s quite popular (same for theme, i.e. water drops) it really needs to stand out to excel.  Compositionally I would have tried to include more foreground water and had less sky to offset the centered horizontal line.  The photo also seems a bit blurry like you may have had some camera shake on a long exposure.  I like the time of day you took this as the reflections are very nice and coordinate with the lower sky sunset.<br/> <br/>I hope you don''t take my above comments the wrong way, I''m just pointing out a couple of things that may be impacting your score.</td>', 'This is a very unique piece of architecture and has shown up frequently here at DPC.  That''s all fine, but unfortunately, it''s been done a little better in the past than this one.  If you are going to revisit a location that''s quite popular (same for theme, i.e. water drops) it really needs to stand out to excel.  Compositionally I would have tried to include more foreground water and had less sky to offset the centered horizontal line.  The photo also seems a bit blurry like you may have had some camera shake on a long exposure.  I like the time of day you took this as the reflections are very nice and coordinate with the lower sky sunset. I hope you don''t take my above comments the wrong way, I''m just pointing out a couple of things that may be impacting your score.', '2007-05-02 13:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3605954, 505355, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the leading lines and the positioning of the person in this photo.  Nice job of guiding the viewer with your compositional choices.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the leading lines and the positioning of the person in this photo.  Nice job of guiding the viewer with your compositional choices.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-05-02 13:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
