(3607152, 504268, 3032, '<td valign="top">Hey, that windmill wasn''t there last time I checked this field!<br/>Pretty straight cut at the end of the field, but at first glance you do not notice it. Nice work. :)<br/>One of the things that also gives it away that the field and windmill are not the same shot is the shadows. The little shed has the shadow on the right side, the shadow of the flowers goes to the left side. Flipping the tulips is a solution. Don''t think anyone will see though.<br/> <br/>Arghhhh, everyone takes better windmill pics than me. :(</td>', 'Hey, that windmill wasn''t there last time I checked this field!Pretty straight cut at the end of the field, but at first glance you do not notice it. Nice work. :)One of the things that also gives it away that the field and windmill are not the same shot is the shadows. The little shed has the shadow on the right side, the shadow of the flowers goes to the left side. Flipping the tulips is a solution. Don''t think anyone will see though. Arghhhh, everyone takes better windmill pics than me. :(', '2007-05-02 18:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
