(3607461, 505253, 25890, '<td valign="top">Each of the three frames is quite good in its own right, and my favorite is the largest one (It''d be even better if the wave were not clipped on the right-hand side; i.e. slightly wider angle of view). However, the triptych as a whole seems to lack coherence, in my opinion, as the photograph with the surfer, although loosely connected, does not quite share the theme of the other two. I don''t know, maybe if the one with the surfer were the dominant frame, I might have gotten a different impression.</td>', 'Each of the three frames is quite good in its own right, and my favorite is the largest one (It''d be even better if the wave were not clipped on the right-hand side; i.e. slightly wider angle of view). However, the triptych as a whole seems to lack coherence, in my opinion, as the photograph with the surfer, although loosely connected, does not quite share the theme of the other two. I don''t know, maybe if the one with the surfer were the dominant frame, I might have gotten a different impression.', '2007-05-02 19:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
