(3607759, 504789, 23458, '<td valign="top">Wow. The bad first: this guy is way too clean cut - the short hair and clean-shaving detracts slightly from the authenticity of the shot. The good: this is my favourite shot so far. Creative and visually stunning. 10.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-05-08 03:22:50.</i></td>', 'Wow. The bad first: this guy is way too clean cut - the short hair and clean-shaving detracts slightly from the authenticity of the shot. The good: this is my favourite shot so far. Creative and visually stunning. 10.', '2007-05-02 21:06:22.000000', '2007-05-08 04:22:50.000000', 1),
(3607760, 498303, 65234, '<td valign="top">Aww!  Good job getting the ferret to hold still.  DOF is very nice for the subjects.</td>', 'Aww!  Good job getting the ferret to hold still.  DOF is very nice for the subjects.', '2007-05-02 21:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607765, 505507, 65234, '<td valign="top">There''s not much to see at this size.</td>', 'There''s not much to see at this size.', '2007-05-02 21:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607774, 503925, 10867, '<td valign="top">Love your title.  Very interesting image, too.</td>', 'Love your title.  Very interesting image, too.', '2007-05-02 21:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607783, 504789, 25890, '<td valign="top">Photographs of half or fully naked and often filthy guys/gals in dilapidated environments writhing in existential agony seem to be quite fashionable these days. Oh those and the portraits -often low key- in which the model is screaming his/her head off for some bizarre reason. But I digress...The Shakespearean touch and having the skeleton mirror the guy''s posture are clever. Both the model and the skeleton seem to be getting lost amidst the pronounced textures of the ground and the wall. The window breaks the visual flow between the two and draws a little too much attention. Yet, I can''t help but think that these actually help the picture reach its intended goal. All in all, maybe not awefully interesting, but still a good image.</td>', 'Photographs of half or fully naked and often filthy guys/gals in dilapidated environments writhing in existential agony seem to be quite fashionable these days. Oh those and the portraits -often low key- in which the model is screaming his/her head off for some bizarre reason. But I digress...The Shakespearean touch and having the skeleton mirror the guy''s posture are clever. Both the model and the skeleton seem to be getting lost amidst the pronounced textures of the ground and the wall. The window breaks the visual flow between the two and draws a little too much attention. Yet, I can''t help but think that these actually help the picture reach its intended goal. All in all, maybe not awefully interesting, but still a good image.', '2007-05-02 21:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607794, 502102, 69493, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, it is different from the rest of the pack.  The halos work well here,</td>', 'I like this shot, it is different from the rest of the pack.  The halos work well here,', '2007-05-02 21:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607797, 502960, 23458, '<td valign="top">Ahh there is something to be said for the good aussie hotel. Great colours. Could have perhaps been improved by a slightly wider angle - getting the crossing sign all the way in. Maybe a lower perspective too.</td>', 'Ahh there is something to be said for the good aussie hotel. Great colours. Could have perhaps been improved by a slightly wider angle - getting the crossing sign all the way in. Maybe a lower perspective too.', '2007-05-02 21:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607800, 503828, 69493, '<td valign="top">Those eyes are amazing.  The tones are perfect here.  Great shot!!!</td>', 'Those eyes are amazing.  The tones are perfect here.  Great shot!!!', '2007-05-02 21:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607811, 503122, 23458, '<td valign="top">That is an intensely beautiful sky. Love the colour treatment and the vingette. 8.</td>', 'That is an intensely beautiful sky. Love the colour treatment and the vingette. 8.', '2007-05-02 21:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607812, 497943, 69493, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I love the reflexion of the lights on the water.  Wonderful exposure.  I have seen this shot done so many times but this is the best I have ever seen.</td>', 'Great shot, I love the reflexion of the lights on the water.  Wonderful exposure.  I have seen this shot done so many times but this is the best I have ever seen.', '2007-05-02 21:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607817, 505022, 69493, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I wonderful tonal range.  The colors are great in this shot.  I can''t find anything to nit pick on this shot.  Good job. -10<br/> <br/>My first ten vote of this free study.  :)</td>', 'Great shot.  I wonderful tonal range.  The colors are great in this shot.  I can''t find anything to nit pick on this shot.  Good job. -10 My first ten vote of this free study.  :)', '2007-05-02 21:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607821, 502344, 23458, '<td valign="top">Love the light at the top of the hill - the rest of the image might be a little flat, but it''s still pretty effective. 6</td>', 'Love the light at the top of the hill - the rest of the image might be a little flat, but it''s still pretty effective. 6', '2007-05-02 21:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607824, 503876, 69493, '<td valign="top">Great use of colors in this shot.  Her eyes are amazing.  I would prefer a closer crop in order to see her eyes better.</td>', 'Great use of colors in this shot.  Her eyes are amazing.  I would prefer a closer crop in order to see her eyes better.', '2007-05-02 21:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607832, 504840, 69493, '<td valign="top">IMO- a tighter crop to show more details in the car and crop out the blurry people on the right side.</td>', 'IMO- a tighter crop to show more details in the car and crop out the blurry people on the right side.', '2007-05-02 21:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607836, 505123, 69493, '<td valign="top">I would prefer this shot from a different angle.  Possibly more to the right so that you could get more details of the door in the shot.</td>', 'I would prefer this shot from a different angle.  Possibly more to the right so that you could get more details of the door in the shot.', '2007-05-02 21:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607838, 505395, 23458, '<td valign="top">Very sensuous. There is something emminently kissable about those lips - love the slightly devilish look in the eyes - well captured!</td>', 'Very sensuous. There is something emminently kissable about those lips - love the slightly devilish look in the eyes - well captured!', '2007-05-02 21:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607840, 503876, 65234, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what processing you did but I really love the way this came out.  Almost animated-cartoon-like, but with a young subject it doesn''t look horribly fake.  She looks quite proud of her braids and her eyes are just mesmerizing.  Background is complementary.  Really, everything about this just works for me.  Thanks for sharing your talent!</td>', 'Don''t know what processing you did but I really love the way this came out.  Almost animated-cartoon-like, but with a young subject it doesn''t look horribly fake.  She looks quite proud of her braids and her eyes are just mesmerizing.  Background is complementary.  Really, everything about this just works for me.  Thanks for sharing your talent!', '2007-05-02 21:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607843, 505288, 69493, '<td valign="top">IMO- Needs a bit of sharpening and the eyes could be a bit brighter.  I love the expression on his/her face.  Possibly a tighter crop in order to show more of the face.</td>', 'IMO- Needs a bit of sharpening and the eyes could be a bit brighter.  I love the expression on his/her face.  Possibly a tighter crop in order to show more of the face.', '2007-05-02 21:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607846, 500041, 23458, '<td valign="top">Love the graphic-novel-esque feel here. Love the concept and execution. 9.</td>', 'Love the graphic-novel-esque feel here. Love the concept and execution. 9.', '2007-05-02 21:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607849, 491967, 7743, '<td valign="top">The focus on the face is good and the viewer is drawn directly to it, however, one eye has a much stronger blue tone to it than the other and it''s very distracting.</td>', 'The focus on the face is good and the viewer is drawn directly to it, however, one eye has a much stronger blue tone to it than the other and it''s very distracting.', '2007-05-02 21:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607850, 501944, 69493, '<td valign="top">Great use of tones in this shot.  The possessing is not something I would normally like but it works well here.</td>', 'Great use of tones in this shot.  The possessing is not something I would normally like but it works well here.', '2007-05-02 21:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607858, 505362, 69493, '<td valign="top">Wow, what wonderful details in the bug.  I am not to sure what that is.  I don''t know bugs too well.  The colors and set up of this shot are perfect.  The lighting and focus are great.</td>', 'Wow, what wonderful details in the bug.  I am not to sure what that is.  I don''t know bugs too well.  The colors and set up of this shot are perfect.  The lighting and focus are great.', '2007-05-02 21:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607865, 500422, 69493, '<td valign="top">IMO- a tighter crop would help draw more focus to the bee.  Also some sharpening and tonal adjustment on the bee would help.</td>', 'IMO- a tighter crop would help draw more focus to the bee.  Also some sharpening and tonal adjustment on the bee would help.', '2007-05-02 21:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607874, 504790, 69493, '<td valign="top">IMO- Needs a bit of brightening.  You are loosing a lot of details of the area that is in the shade.</td>', 'IMO- Needs a bit of brightening.  You are loosing a lot of details of the area that is in the shade.', '2007-05-02 21:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607880, 505655, 23458, '<td valign="top">Heheh fantastic - best title in the challenge. Amazing moss, and great use of light and shadow. Would be a ten and a ribbon winner in a "where''s waldo" challenge. Here you''ll have to settle for an eight from me!</td>', 'Heheh fantastic - best title in the challenge. Amazing moss, and great use of light and shadow. Would be a ten and a ribbon winner in a "where''s waldo" challenge. Here you''ll have to settle for an eight from me!', '2007-05-02 21:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607884, 499447, 69493, '<td valign="top">IMO- The girls need to be sharpened a bit.  The whole shot needs to be brightened up.</td>', 'IMO- The girls need to be sharpened a bit.  The whole shot needs to be brightened up.', '2007-05-02 21:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607887, 494049, 71188, '<td valign="top">very out of focus</td>', 'very out of focus', '2007-05-02 21:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
