(3608306, 505497, 35352, '<td valign="top">Nice colours in this photo. I think people get fustrated when they see a glimpse of something and they can''t see the rest of it. In a photo, I think its fine if you tease the viewer with just one main object like the Church here but you have a whole row of houses that you can just make out that are cut but the edge of the yellow flowers. Your photo really makes my head think I''m in that field and it wants me to stand up a bit so I can see more.....I better stop rambling....</td>', 'Nice colours in this photo. I think people get fustrated when they see a glimpse of something and they can''t see the rest of it. In a photo, I think its fine if you tease the viewer with just one main object like the Church here but you have a whole row of houses that you can just make out that are cut but the edge of the yellow flowers. Your photo really makes my head think I''m in that field and it wants me to stand up a bit so I can see more.....I better stop rambling....', '2007-05-02 23:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
