(3608568, 505639, 67841, '<td valign="top">well done - you captured the water in a way you don''t often see outside of illustrations &amp; computer generated imagery.  I wish the background had a bit more substance to it, though, in order to match the intricacies of the waves.  &lt;&lt; 8 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'well done - you captured the water in a way you don''t often see outside of illustrations & computer generated imagery.  I wish the background had a bit more substance to it, though, in order to match the intricacies of the waves.  << 8 >>', '2007-05-03 00:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
