(3608603, 505420, 77397, '<td valign="top">Great - barefoot - lighting - wonderful shot</td>', 'Great - barefoot - lighting - wonderful shot', '2007-05-03 00:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3608606, 492291, 27763, '<td valign="top">Clearly, the girl in the lower left is the focus of this shot.  Almost out of the frame, she''s not exactly looking through the camera, but rather looking past it, at us.  She''s the one I identify with.  To me, the other figures in the frame seem to be centered around her, like (if I''m not going too far out on a limb) they could be elements of her psyche.  The figure with the beverage reminds me of death, waiting patiently for her in the distance, and I suppose that the man in the knit hat could be life, casually sitting close to her.  And the three sleeping(?) figures in the background are just plain mysterious.  I don''t know what they are.  Maybe she doesn''t either.  But they are significant... <br/>The whole thing strikes me as rather dreamlike.</td>', 'Clearly, the girl in the lower left is the focus of this shot.  Almost out of the frame, she''s not exactly looking through the camera, but rather looking past it, at us.  She''s the one I identify with.  To me, the other figures in the frame seem to be centered around her, like (if I''m not going too far out on a limb) they could be elements of her psyche.  The figure with the beverage reminds me of death, waiting patiently for her in the distance, and I suppose that the man in the knit hat could be life, casually sitting close to her.  And the three sleeping(?) figures in the background are just plain mysterious.  I don''t know what they are.  Maybe she doesn''t either.  But they are significant... The whole thing strikes me as rather dreamlike.', '2007-05-03 00:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3608609, 504505, 77397, '<td valign="top">nice job</td>', 'nice job', '2007-05-03 00:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3608612, 504950, 67841, '<td valign="top">just when I thought I was tired of seeing photos of this bridge...  nice work!</td>', 'just when I thought I was tired of seeing photos of this bridge...  nice work!', '2007-05-03 00:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3608615, 502900, 77397, '<td valign="top">love it - great action</td>', 'love it - great action', '2007-05-03 00:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3608617, 497490, 10867, '<td valign="top">This image is, unfortunately, a good bit overexposed.  As a result, there is very little detail in the light parts of the bird.  Also the branches in the top foreground are very hot and distracting, as is the very busy background.  The bird is pretty and well placed in the frame, so it''s really a shame that the image is so busy and blown out.</td>', 'This image is, unfortunately, a good bit overexposed.  As a result, there is very little detail in the light parts of the bird.  Also the branches in the top foreground are very hot and distracting, as is the very busy background.  The bird is pretty and well placed in the frame, so it''s really a shame that the image is so busy and blown out.', '2007-05-03 00:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3608622, 503802, 77397, '<td valign="top">love it great shot</td>', 'love it great shot', '2007-05-03 00:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3608628, 503045, 77397, '<td valign="top">Great job superb shot</td>', 'Great job superb shot', '2007-05-03 00:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
