(3608673, 500513, 67834, '<td valign="top">very minimalistic! <br/>I like the use of the grey dull background to put all the empthasis on the flower, it really makes it stand out and becomes the main focal point which i''m sure is what you set out to achieve. <br/>If i had to make one criticism it would be the fact that there is too much dead space, although i''m not sure cropping would have helped in this case as I like the fact the buds are in the picture too. Perhaps taking this from a different angle would help to tighten things up a bit? Just my 2 cents. :o)</td>', 'very minimalistic! I like the use of the grey dull background to put all the empthasis on the flower, it really makes it stand out and becomes the main focal point which i''m sure is what you set out to achieve. If i had to make one criticism it would be the fact that there is too much dead space, although i''m not sure cropping would have helped in this case as I like the fact the buds are in the picture too. Perhaps taking this from a different angle would help to tighten things up a bit? Just my 2 cents. :o)', '2007-05-03 00:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3608679, 496378, 77397, '<td valign="top">wonderful shot</td>', 'wonderful shot', '2007-05-03 00:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
