(3608702, 505120, 67834, '<td valign="top">I wonder if Frodo is in? <br/>I like everything about it except the matt on the floor, i''m not really sure it goes with everything else? But then I can''t really decide. <br/>Perhaps might have also looked good with the lights turned softly on? <br/>Overall though it''s a greap capture and technically very good</td>', 'I wonder if Frodo is in? I like everything about it except the matt on the floor, i''m not really sure it goes with everything else? But then I can''t really decide. Perhaps might have also looked good with the lights turned softly on? Overall though it''s a greap capture and technically very good', '2007-05-03 00:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
