(3608714, 505674, 77397, '<td valign="top">awesome -----</td>', 'awesome -----', '2007-05-03 00:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3608716, 505660, 67834, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm i could imagine this would have been a very hard image to capture, especially with all the snow and reflection around, so technically you''ve done really well. There is only one thing that lets this down IMO and that is the background, it is simply too dark and too busy which detracts from the cart itself and means it doesn''t stand out as much as it could. If anything it would have been better if there was more snow covering the dark rocks in the background then the brown cart would have been against a white background and it would have stood out a lot more.</td>', 'Hmmmm i could imagine this would have been a very hard image to capture, especially with all the snow and reflection around, so technically you''ve done really well. There is only one thing that lets this down IMO and that is the background, it is simply too dark and too busy which detracts from the cart itself and means it doesn''t stand out as much as it could. If anything it would have been better if there was more snow covering the dark rocks in the background then the brown cart would have been against a white background and it would have stood out a lot more.', '2007-05-03 00:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
