(3608742, 504415, 67834, '<td valign="top">nice idea but the way it''s been editted in photoshop makes it look really fake and not necessarily in a good way. <br/>The sky is okay but where it joins the rock on the right hand side does not look right, almost as if you have cut the rock out and stuck it over the top of the sky, and there is a fair amount of purple along the edges of the rock and branches which i''m sure is not meant to be there?</td>', 'nice idea but the way it''s been editted in photoshop makes it look really fake and not necessarily in a good way. The sky is okay but where it joins the rock on the right hand side does not look right, almost as if you have cut the rock out and stuck it over the top of the sky, and there is a fair amount of purple along the edges of the rock and branches which i''m sure is not meant to be there?', '2007-05-03 00:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
