(3609244, 505666, 76198, '<td valign="top">This is a nice picture, of a pretty model... skin looks good to me, and the blakc shirt/background makes her stand out nicely. Her features seem maybe a little flat; perhaps a slight turn of the head or some cross lighting would help?</td>', 'This is a nice picture, of a pretty model... skin looks good to me, and the blakc shirt/background makes her stand out nicely. Her features seem maybe a little flat; perhaps a slight turn of the head or some cross lighting would help?', '2007-05-03 03:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609246, 505738, 76198, '<td valign="top">nice picture, and beautifully lit for outdoors. Was there artificial lighting on this one?</td>', 'nice picture, and beautifully lit for outdoors. Was there artificial lighting on this one?', '2007-05-03 03:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609247, 500041, 48479, '<td valign="top">extra points just for the time this would have taken</td>', 'extra points just for the time this would have taken', '2007-05-03 03:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609250, 505690, 76198, '<td valign="top">nice colors and scenery (California, I assume?). It has a pastoral quality, but also with some urbanesque grit. The diagonal line of the coast is a powerful compositional feature, and the seagull is a nice choice. I would have asked him to fly slightly to the left ;)<br/> <br/>I''m not a big fan of the soft focus in this one; I haven''t figured out why sometimes it works for me and sometimes not.</td>', 'nice colors and scenery (California, I assume?). It has a pastoral quality, but also with some urbanesque grit. The diagonal line of the coast is a powerful compositional feature, and the seagull is a nice choice. I would have asked him to fly slightly to the left ;) I''m not a big fan of the soft focus in this one; I haven''t figured out why sometimes it works for me and sometimes not.', '2007-05-03 03:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609252, 505660, 76198, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, and well processed; you can see lots of great detail in the wood grain and such. Compositionally a bit dull, and the background is cluttered, which distracts from the subject.</td>', 'Nice subject, and well processed; you can see lots of great detail in the wood grain and such. Compositionally a bit dull, and the background is cluttered, which distracts from the subject.', '2007-05-03 03:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609254, 503448, 35352, '<td valign="top">Needs some better lighting - esp on the dogs face.</td>', 'Needs some better lighting - esp on the dogs face.', '2007-05-03 03:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609256, 496040, 35352, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome juxtaposition. The detail of the plant and the realism of the kid are great. Maybe a little less black space on the right and some focus up the top would have been better.</td>', 'This is an awesome juxtaposition. The detail of the plant and the realism of the kid are great. Maybe a little less black space on the right and some focus up the top would have been better.', '2007-05-03 03:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609259, 505682, 76198, '<td valign="top">I really like this. The 5 shades of blue, multiple symmetries, abstract form, great texture... A nice subject and beautifully captured. <br/> <br/>I don''t know how well it would have worked, but could you change the perspective so the windowframes (vertical) were parallel to the image frame? I think (not certain) that that would improve it for me.</td>', 'I really like this. The 5 shades of blue, multiple symmetries, abstract form, great texture... A nice subject and beautifully captured.  I don''t know how well it would have worked, but could you change the perspective so the windowframes (vertical) were parallel to the image frame? I think (not certain) that that would improve it for me.', '2007-05-03 03:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609261, 500067, 35352, '<td valign="top">I think this would have worked better in landscape orientation. The focus is too much on the bright sky and not the abandoned shed.</td>', 'I think this would have worked better in landscape orientation. The focus is too much on the bright sky and not the abandoned shed.', '2007-05-03 03:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609264, 505709, 35352, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF of the walls here. And our main man seems to fit into his environment. It a bit of putting though that he is in clear focus but the wall that is also in clear focus is well behind him.</td>', 'I like the DOF of the walls here. And our main man seems to fit into his environment. It a bit of putting though that he is in clear focus but the wall that is also in clear focus is well behind him.', '2007-05-03 03:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609266, 505388, 76198, '<td valign="top">Yikes! I never know how to rate these... It''s certainly not pretty, but it''s powerful and thought-provoking, thus clearly effective. The left image, in particular, seems quite surreal. Excellent job in post, colors and textures are great. <br/> <br/>This is getting very nit-picky, and I don''t know the effects of the drugs here, but I read in this a very immediate fear, but less of the longer-term angst that I might expect or desire to see. She looks like she''s afraid of someone outside the door, but not like she sees this state as a reflection of longer-term lifestyle choices...<br/> <br/>Anyway, obviously if I''m going there I think your technicals are esentially perfect and the overall effect is really good. 10.</td>', 'Yikes! I never know how to rate these... It''s certainly not pretty, but it''s powerful and thought-provoking, thus clearly effective. The left image, in particular, seems quite surreal. Excellent job in post, colors and textures are great.  This is getting very nit-picky, and I don''t know the effects of the drugs here, but I read in this a very immediate fear, but less of the longer-term angst that I might expect or desire to see. She looks like she''s afraid of someone outside the door, but not like she sees this state as a reflection of longer-term lifestyle choices... Anyway, obviously if I''m going there I think your technicals are esentially perfect and the overall effect is really good. 10.', '2007-05-03 03:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609267, 496378, 35352, '<td valign="top">I love the detail of the brickwork - its all come out. It just needs better framing - less sky and a cut of the thin wall strip on the left.</td>', 'I love the detail of the brickwork - its all come out. It just needs better framing - less sky and a cut of the thin wall strip on the left.', '2007-05-03 03:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609269, 496747, 76198, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene. You''ve got a bit of a pink halo ''round the sunset, maybe form oversaturation?</td>', 'Beautiful scene. You''ve got a bit of a pink halo ''round the sunset, maybe form oversaturation?', '2007-05-03 03:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609270, 505459, 35352, '<td valign="top">Great photo. Nice subtle use of DOF.</td>', 'Great photo. Nice subtle use of DOF.', '2007-05-03 03:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609272, 504881, 76198, '<td valign="top">great colors and composition. Don''t even know if this is possible, but a shot from below mght have conveyed a sense of scale better.</td>', 'great colors and composition. Don''t even know if this is possible, but a shot from below mght have conveyed a sense of scale better.', '2007-05-03 03:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609275, 499458, 76198, '<td valign="top">Nice subjet and capture. I''d like to see a little more context - a little more negtive space on the right. I also find the sunset oversaturated, it''s causing some weirdness in the clouds near the horizon.</td>', 'Nice subjet and capture. I''d like to see a little more context - a little more negtive space on the right. I also find the sunset oversaturated, it''s causing some weirdness in the clouds near the horizon.', '2007-05-03 03:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609277, 504931, 76198, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty scene... the composition is nice; my eye is led from the lefthand frame into the picture and out the back. <br/> <br/>Technicals have some problems, though; at least in post... the sun is so bright, and the plants so dark, that it''s hard to really see the whole scene without effort. I''d have tried (and I sure no expert) a little fill flash on the forground plants, and curves to brighten the sky and water and bring out the sunset colors that are one of the major assets of this image.</td>', 'This is a very pretty scene... the composition is nice; my eye is led from the lefthand frame into the picture and out the back.  Technicals have some problems, though; at least in post... the sun is so bright, and the plants so dark, that it''s hard to really see the whole scene without effort. I''d have tried (and I sure no expert) a little fill flash on the forground plants, and curves to brighten the sky and water and bring out the sunset colors that are one of the major assets of this image.', '2007-05-03 03:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609278, 500638, 35352, '<td valign="top">the focus here is on the flowers and not the great wide open. Its like the guy has left his kid behind who doesn''t want to go on the walk. :-)</td>', 'the focus here is on the flowers and not the great wide open. Its like the guy has left his kid behind who doesn''t want to go on the walk. :-)', '2007-05-03 03:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
