(3609282, 505698, 76198, '<td valign="top">A veyr sweet pic, and nicely framed in the doorway. reflections off the back wall are distracting and easy to remove, and as much as I''m a huge fan of vignetting, I find the relatively hard edge here draws my eye AWAY from your subject, in effect emphasizing the very things it was meant to de-emphasize.</td>', 'A veyr sweet pic, and nicely framed in the doorway. reflections off the back wall are distracting and easy to remove, and as much as I''m a huge fan of vignetting, I find the relatively hard edge here draws my eye AWAY from your subject, in effect emphasizing the very things it was meant to de-emphasize.', '2007-05-03 03:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
