(3609975, 503939, 40355, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, with great colors and composition.  The stacking of the fence, windmill, and barn is excellent, as all share the straight wood patterns, but each runs in a different plane of direction.  Easily a 10!</td>', 'Lovely shot, with great colors and composition.  The stacking of the fence, windmill, and barn is excellent, as all share the straight wood patterns, but each runs in a different plane of direction.  Easily a 10!', '2007-05-03 10:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609976, 504237, 66597, '<td valign="top">I recall a different version of this in previous contest. I have to say I actually preferred teh first version. The popped greens are pretty, but the photo no longer has the same aura of mystery.</td>', 'I recall a different version of this in previous contest. I have to say I actually preferred teh first version. The popped greens are pretty, but the photo no longer has the same aura of mystery.', '2007-05-03 10:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610006, 505059, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice texture and wonderful color.  Your choices made while composing this work well as I really like the way the light moves from top left down into the image.  Wish I didn''t have to scroll down to see the whole thing.</td>', 'Nice texture and wonderful color.  Your choices made while composing this work well as I really like the way the light moves from top left down into the image.  Wish I didn''t have to scroll down to see the whole thing.', '2007-05-03 10:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610009, 497631, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting piece.  The lighting is quite nice and the composition overall works.  If ONLY this photo was in focus, you''d have a fairly high placing entry.  :/  Good luck.</td>', 'This is an interesting piece.  The lighting is quite nice and the composition overall works.  If ONLY this photo was in focus, you''d have a fairly high placing entry.  :/  Good luck.', '2007-05-03 11:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610014, 505712, 66597, '<td valign="top">Attack of the killer grasshoppers? :-)</td>', 'Attack of the killer grasshoppers? :-)', '2007-05-03 11:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610015, 495754, 66597, '<td valign="top">Love the simplicity here. Gorgeous dynamic range.</td>', 'Love the simplicity here. Gorgeous dynamic range.', '2007-05-03 11:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610016, 496604, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s too bad you couldn''t have done a little more to bring out the person on top of the cliff.  I like the way this image portray''s the power of water.  Nicely done in that regard.  Good luck.</td>', 'It''s too bad you couldn''t have done a little more to bring out the person on top of the cliff.  I like the way this image portray''s the power of water.  Nicely done in that regard.  Good luck.', '2007-05-03 11:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610020, 493940, 66597, '<td valign="top">Fabulous Bokeh here - and the background does have a Chihuly look, although I confess I associate his work with undersea fantastia (have you been to his gallery in Tacoma, WA?) Very well done.</td>', 'Fabulous Bokeh here - and the background does have a Chihuly look, although I confess I associate his work with undersea fantastia (have you been to his gallery in Tacoma, WA?) Very well done.', '2007-05-03 11:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610025, 505358, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice color and focus.  Compositionally I''d lose some of the negative space up top in the sky.  I have to scroll down to view the bottom 10% or so of this image (which is frustrating not being able to take it all in).  When I do scroll down it looks better - consider it an auto-crop.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice color and focus.  Compositionally I''d lose some of the negative space up top in the sky.  I have to scroll down to view the bottom 10% or so of this image (which is frustrating not being able to take it all in).  When I do scroll down it looks better - consider it an auto-crop.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-05-03 11:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610027, 497107, 30049, '<td valign="top">Looks like cloth or linen it''s so soft.  Good job of capturing that quality without overprocessing.</td>', 'Looks like cloth or linen it''s so soft.  Good job of capturing that quality without overprocessing.', '2007-05-03 11:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610033, 505281, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice POV. Wonderful pattern and lines.  Seems overexposed and oversharpened IMO.</td>', 'Nice POV. Wonderful pattern and lines.  Seems overexposed and oversharpened IMO.', '2007-05-03 11:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610054, 505655, 30049, '<td valign="top">The hood works great!  This is like a "Where''s Waldo" kind of shot.  Clever.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The hood works great!  This is like a "Where''s Waldo" kind of shot.  Clever.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-05-03 11:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610061, 502538, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hey!  Quit chewing on the tree!!!  :)  Fun photo overall and good use of light.  Seems to be just a tad oversharpened.  Good luck.</td>', 'Hey!  Quit chewing on the tree!!!  :)  Fun photo overall and good use of light.  Seems to be just a tad oversharpened.  Good luck.', '2007-05-03 11:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610079, 504310, 30049, '<td valign="top">I''d have pushed the high key even more, but try and save the eyes.  Somehow this seems a little unbalanced with the lighting effort.  The upper left appears as a nicely toned B/W photo, yet the bottom 2/3''s of the face is blownout.  Compositionally what you''ve included in the frame works well.  One last thought, I think the eyes should be clearer.  There''s too much of the white reflector showing and is distracting.<br/> <br/>All of the above is JMO of course.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''d have pushed the high key even more, but try and save the eyes.  Somehow this seems a little unbalanced with the lighting effort.  The upper left appears as a nicely toned B/W photo, yet the bottom 2/3''s of the face is blownout.  Compositionally what you''ve included in the frame works well.  One last thought, I think the eyes should be clearer.  There''s too much of the white reflector showing and is distracting. All of the above is JMO of course.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-05-03 11:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610084, 498303, 30049, '<td valign="top">A deeper DOF would have brought the girls face into focus.  As is, only one of the "TWO" is sharp.  Cool looking pet.  I do like your choice of B/W for this, although I think the range could be covered better at the high end (no true whites visible).<br/> <br/>All JMO of course.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'A deeper DOF would have brought the girls face into focus.  As is, only one of the "TWO" is sharp.  Cool looking pet.  I do like your choice of B/W for this, although I think the range could be covered better at the high end (no true whites visible). All JMO of course.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-05-03 11:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610090, 503448, 19436, '<td valign="top">Love the stare. Good Shot.</td>', 'Love the stare. Good Shot.', '2007-05-03 11:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610105, 504688, 77278, '<td valign="top">is that a flower?</td>', 'is that a flower?', '2007-05-03 11:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610106, 504931, 30049, '<td valign="top">If you would have waited about 3 minutes longer you''d have a nice sunset glow and lighting.  With the use of HDR available you could have even brought back some foreground if desired (after waiting 3 minutes for the sun to set the foreground would be darker yet).  As is, the sun is a bit too blown out for me.  I''m also not seeing a strong subject theme.  The river forms a nice leading line, but it takes you to the center of the frame.  The brush and distant shoreline to the left aren''t adding as much to this composition as the nice golden glow on the water to the right does.  I''d emphasize the right side more via repositioning yourself at the time of image capture or in cropping while post-processing.  Try to get the horizon more off-center as well.<br/> <br/>All JMO of course.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'If you would have waited about 3 minutes longer you''d have a nice sunset glow and lighting.  With the use of HDR available you could have even brought back some foreground if desired (after waiting 3 minutes for the sun to set the foreground would be darker yet).  As is, the sun is a bit too blown out for me.  I''m also not seeing a strong subject theme.  The river forms a nice leading line, but it takes you to the center of the frame.  The brush and distant shoreline to the left aren''t adding as much to this composition as the nice golden glow on the water to the right does.  I''d emphasize the right side more via repositioning yourself at the time of image capture or in cropping while post-processing.  Try to get the horizon more off-center as well. All JMO of course.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-05-03 11:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610111, 503528, 77278, '<td valign="top">bad subject</td>', 'bad subject', '2007-05-03 11:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610113, 497194, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good thing it was submitted before the triptych since it seems to have 4 images being used.  :P  I really like the lower left image.  Not seeing how the images assembled here come together to tell a story. ???  Good luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Good thing it was submitted before the triptych since it seems to have 4 images being used.  :P  I really like the lower left image.  Not seeing how the images assembled here come together to tell a story. ???  Good luck to you in the challenge.', '2007-05-03 11:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610114, 505205, 77278, '<td valign="top">How unrealistic!!! Sorry galaxies are not that close to each other ever!</td>', 'How unrealistic!!! Sorry galaxies are not that close to each other ever!', '2007-05-03 11:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610120, 503519, 77278, '<td valign="top">Work more on the clouds. The pic is a bit grainy too.</td>', 'Work more on the clouds. The pic is a bit grainy too.', '2007-05-03 11:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610125, 498421, 30049, '<td valign="top">I want to be drawn to the eye, but it''s placed uncomfortably in this composition and is too distant.  Some minor cropping, sharpening, and a little more contrast would do wonders for this photo.  JMO of course.  :D<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I want to be drawn to the eye, but it''s placed uncomfortably in this composition and is too distant.  Some minor cropping, sharpening, and a little more contrast would do wonders for this photo.  JMO of course.  :D Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-05-03 11:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610129, 504790, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the light in this, and the color of the dogwood pops out nicely.  The large boulder and the log pole add a nice visual touch to bring the viewer into the photo.  I do wish the image was a little sharper in the background.  Did you use a deep aperture setting?  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the light in this, and the color of the dogwood pops out nicely.  The large boulder and the log pole add a nice visual touch to bring the viewer into the photo.  I do wish the image was a little sharper in the background.  Did you use a deep aperture setting?  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-05-03 11:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610139, 504864, 77278, '<td valign="top">Good Subject! But I had to <i>tilt</i> my head to see it.</td>', 'Good Subject! But I had to tilt my head to see it.', '2007-05-03 11:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610147, 505359, 70000, '<td valign="top">Very cool long exposure, its unfortunate that there is a pole in front of the wheel because it kind of breaks up the composition</td>', 'Very cool long exposure, its unfortunate that there is a pole in front of the wheel because it kind of breaks up the composition', '2007-05-03 11:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610150, 498635, 70000, '<td valign="top">Wow beautiful! I love the detail of the hair on the dear. Even though she is sillhouetted you can see the detail on her. GReat lighting  and angle.</td>', 'Wow beautiful! I love the detail of the hair on the dear. Even though she is sillhouetted you can see the detail on her. GReat lighting  and angle.', '2007-05-03 11:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610255, 505607, 34134, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Love the composition, sharpness and bg color.</td>', 'Very nice. Love the composition, sharpness and bg color.', '2007-05-03 12:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610265, 505057, 34134, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Appears to be a well thought-out theme masterfully executed. Great contrast. 10</td>', 'Excellent. Appears to be a well thought-out theme masterfully executed. Great contrast. 10', '2007-05-03 12:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610272, 504759, 34134, '<td valign="top">Like the tight crop. Needs to be sharper though.</td>', 'Like the tight crop. Needs to be sharper though.', '2007-05-03 12:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610277, 496738, 34134, '<td valign="top">Creepy! I love it.</td>', 'Creepy! I love it.', '2007-05-03 12:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610330, 504237, 30049, '<td valign="top">Held back the best one did you?  :)  ==&gt; <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=499061" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/668/thumb/499061.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/668/thumb/499061.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/668/thumb/499061.jpg"/></a>.  Of course it may not be yours (in the <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/challenge_results.php?CHALLENGE_ID=668" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Landscape III</a> challenge), but I like this one ("The blue forest") much better.  The colors are deeper, the lines are stunning, and the lighting is less harsh.  Perfect! 10</td>', 'Held back the best one did you?  :)  ==> .  Of course it may not be yours (in the Landscape III challenge), but I like this one ("The blue forest") much better.  The colors are deeper, the lines are stunning, and the lighting is less harsh.  Perfect! 10', '2007-05-03 12:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610337, 501721, 34134, '<td valign="top">This needs to be run through noise reduction. Nice compositional capture, but blowing it up so much caused excessive noise.</td>', 'This needs to be run through noise reduction. Nice compositional capture, but blowing it up so much caused excessive noise.', '2007-05-03 12:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610354, 505548, 34134, '<td valign="top">More contrast would make this even better.</td>', 'More contrast would make this even better.', '2007-05-03 12:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610359, 505620, 30049, '<td valign="top">Need to sharpen the blade on that lawnmower!  :D  Nice photo overall.  The dandelion head seems like it could be sharper (or less noise reduction used).  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Need to sharpen the blade on that lawnmower!  :D  Nice photo overall.  The dandelion head seems like it could be sharper (or less noise reduction used).  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-05-03 12:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610383, 499072, 34134, '<td valign="top">I like it. Nice treatment.</td>', 'I like it. Nice treatment.', '2007-05-03 12:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610387, 498870, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cool looking bird.  I like the way you''ve pulled this bird out of the surrounding foliage.  One question; did you play with curves and or a minor histogram adjustment?  Seems like it''s just a tad underexposed.  Nonetheless, a nice shot.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Cool looking bird.  I like the way you''ve pulled this bird out of the surrounding foliage.  One question; did you play with curves and or a minor histogram adjustment?  Seems like it''s just a tad underexposed.  Nonetheless, a nice shot.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-05-03 12:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610406, 504550, 34134, '<td valign="top">You might consider a tigher crop. Great capture and lighting.</td>', 'You might consider a tigher crop. Great capture and lighting.', '2007-05-03 12:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610416, 503828, 30049, '<td valign="top">Oh man!  This kid is adorable with that hat on!!!  :D  It''s a shame that the focal point seems to have hit the hands and railing leaving his eyes too soft.  Nonetheless, this has to be framed and kept as a memento.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Oh man!  This kid is adorable with that hat on!!!  :D  It''s a shame that the focal point seems to have hit the hands and railing leaving his eyes too soft.  Nonetheless, this has to be framed and kept as a memento.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-05-03 12:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610421, 505298, 34134, '<td valign="top">Like the composition. Not sure about the white frame.</td>', 'Like the composition. Not sure about the white frame.', '2007-05-03 12:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610423, 505355, 34134, '<td valign="top">Good composition and execution.</td>', 'Good composition and execution.', '2007-05-03 12:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610427, 505476, 34134, '<td valign="top">This is GREAT!! Very good composition and treatment.</td>', 'This is GREAT!! Very good composition and treatment.', '2007-05-03 12:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
