(3610465, 505178, 34134, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool. Good capture.</td>', 'Pretty cool. Good capture.', '2007-05-03 12:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610474, 505328, 34134, '<td valign="top">A bit dark on my adjusted CRT monitor (can just barely make out the eyes). Looks much better when I lighten it up. 6</td>', 'A bit dark on my adjusted CRT monitor (can just barely make out the eyes). Looks much better when I lighten it up. 6', '2007-05-03 12:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610480, 501944, 34134, '<td valign="top">You''ll probably get hammered for the treatment, but I like it AND the composition.</td>', 'You''ll probably get hammered for the treatment, but I like it AND the composition.', '2007-05-03 12:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610481, 504505, 41554, '<td valign="top">Nice, I really like the idea and execution. Only thing I don''t really care for is the whitewashed sky.</td>', 'Nice, I really like the idea and execution. Only thing I don''t really care for is the whitewashed sky.', '2007-05-03 12:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610483, 504562, 34134, '<td valign="top">Good composition. Very effective.</td>', 'Good composition. Very effective.', '2007-05-03 12:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610486, 504974, 41554, '<td valign="top">Nice expression, and good exposure control. Nice.</td>', 'Nice expression, and good exposure control. Nice.', '2007-05-03 12:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610543, 505744, 63269, '<td valign="top">Awesome lighting!  This is really, really cool. Everything is perfect. Hope is does well!</td>', 'Awesome lighting!  This is really, really cool. Everything is perfect. Hope is does well!', '2007-05-03 13:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610555, 503006, 63269, '<td valign="top">This is thrilling just to look at. I love how dramatic everythign is.  It''s epic. I only wish it wasn''t grainy... like in the clouds you can see a little. But it''s not too bad, and it''s still a glorious shot!!</td>', 'This is thrilling just to look at. I love how dramatic everythign is.  It''s epic. I only wish it wasn''t grainy... like in the clouds you can see a little. But it''s not too bad, and it''s still a glorious shot!!', '2007-05-03 13:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610561, 503641, 63269, '<td valign="top">really cool! Unique, and interesting idea... I love the bizarrness to this shot. I like the square (or at least squarish) crop a lot, and the way you can''t see the person''s face just adds to the unique-ness! Good job.</td>', 'really cool! Unique, and interesting idea... I love the bizarrness to this shot. I like the square (or at least squarish) crop a lot, and the way you can''t see the person''s face just adds to the unique-ness! Good job.', '2007-05-03 13:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610562, 505507, 45375, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot...just wish it was a little bigger</td>', 'beautiful shot...just wish it was a little bigger', '2007-05-03 13:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610566, 505463, 63269, '<td valign="top">Neat! Il ike the border, although IMO it''s maybe a bit <i>tOO</i> big.  but as for the shot itself, I really love the shallow depth of field. It''s so neat how so much of the shot is just a sweet blur, and rising out of it is the single sharp flower. Nice job!</td>', 'Neat! Il ike the border, although IMO it''s maybe a bit tOO big.  but as for the shot itself, I really love the shallow depth of field. It''s so neat how so much of the shot is just a sweet blur, and rising out of it is the single sharp flower. Nice job!', '2007-05-03 13:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610567, 504112, 63269, '<td valign="top">Cool composition! Neat shot.</td>', 'Cool composition! Neat shot.', '2007-05-03 13:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610569, 500003, 63269, '<td valign="top">IMO a black border might have been nicer, but that''s just me. :) I love the dramatic sky, and the lovely glowing colors against the black shadows. NIce shot!</td>', 'IMO a black border might have been nicer, but that''s just me. :) I love the dramatic sky, and the lovely glowing colors against the black shadows. NIce shot!', '2007-05-03 13:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610575, 505548, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love the high-key of this, how almost everything is white (or almost white) but it''s a little too soft-focused. A soft focus would be nice, but this is just <i>too </i>out of focus.  Pretty shot though!</td>', 'I love the high-key of this, how almost everything is white (or almost white) but it''s a little too soft-focused. A soft focus would be nice, but this is just too out of focus.  Pretty shot though!', '2007-05-03 13:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610578, 504854, 63269, '<td valign="top">Hmm... Good try! Something that would majorly help this shot is the focus of course. If you could get it focused, it would be pretty cool! Also,  some different lighting would be nice - it''s almost too harsh here, and is causing the boys to squint their eyes a little... What might be cool is if you could get them standing in the tree in front of a sunset. But that''s just an idea - Keep shooting! :)</td>', 'Hmm... Good try! Something that would majorly help this shot is the focus of course. If you could get it focused, it would be pretty cool! Also,  some different lighting would be nice - it''s almost too harsh here, and is causing the boys to squint their eyes a little... What might be cool is if you could get them standing in the tree in front of a sunset. But that''s just an idea - Keep shooting! :)', '2007-05-03 13:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610582, 505716, 63269, '<td valign="top">This is really cool... It''s a little too dark, looks like it might needs some work in levels or something... but on the other hand I almost like the darkness.  It creates an awesome mood! Maybe adding some contrast or something... I don''t know. Very cool shot.</td>', 'This is really cool... It''s a little too dark, looks like it might needs some work in levels or something... but on the other hand I almost like the darkness.  It creates an awesome mood! Maybe adding some contrast or something... I don''t know. Very cool shot.', '2007-05-03 13:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610586, 505662, 63269, '<td valign="top">hmm... interesting. I like how you''ve made it black and white... but I''m not sure I like how you cropped it - the person''s head is cut off! Good try though! :)</td>', 'hmm... interesting. I like how you''ve made it black and white... but I''m not sure I like how you cropped it - the person''s head is cut off! Good try though! :)', '2007-05-03 13:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610589, 500304, 63269, '<td valign="top">Brilliant eyes! Interesting post-editing... the lighting might need a little work though - it appears to be almost strait on the subject''s face. If it were off to the side it might look a little nicer. Good shot though!</td>', 'Brilliant eyes! Interesting post-editing... the lighting might need a little work though - it appears to be almost strait on the subject''s face. If it were off to the side it might look a little nicer. Good shot though!', '2007-05-03 13:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610592, 505204, 63269, '<td valign="top">I like the neat atmosphere here... beautiful. Cool use of negative space.</td>', 'I like the neat atmosphere here... beautiful. Cool use of negative space.', '2007-05-03 13:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610616, 502102, 34134, '<td valign="top">Interesting, creative composition. I''d like to see a bit more contrast (blacker blacks).</td>', 'Interesting, creative composition. I''d like to see a bit more contrast (blacker blacks).', '2007-05-03 13:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610637, 505560, 57882, '<td valign="top">Well presented theme.  Really like the lighting.</td>', 'Well presented theme.  Really like the lighting.', '2007-05-03 13:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610641, 505506, 57882, '<td valign="top">Postcard quality.</td>', 'Postcard quality.', '2007-05-03 13:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610646, 500948, 57882, '<td valign="top">Looks like its right out of a storybook.  Nice presentation.</td>', 'Looks like its right out of a storybook.  Nice presentation.', '2007-05-03 13:47:18.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3610650, 505744, 57882, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea that is well executed.  Nice, focused lighting as well.</td>', 'Interesting idea that is well executed.  Nice, focused lighting as well.', '2007-05-03 13:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610654, 505656, 57882, '<td valign="top">A good bit of fun.  The foreground goose is maybe a little too out of focus though.</td>', 'A good bit of fun.  The foreground goose is maybe a little too out of focus though.', '2007-05-03 13:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610662, 505546, 57882, '<td valign="top">Exhilirating panoramic view.</td>', 'Exhilirating panoramic view.', '2007-05-03 13:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610664, 504213, 57882, '<td valign="top">Crisp, clean and simple.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Crisp, clean and simple.  Nicely done!', '2007-05-03 13:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610668, 504647, 5112, '<td valign="top">I love the concept, and it''s well executed.  I am not so sure that the woodgrain backdrop is the best choice here, to me it looks sort of out of place.  Just my opinion though :)  ~8</td>', 'I love the concept, and it''s well executed.  I am not so sure that the woodgrain backdrop is the best choice here, to me it looks sort of out of place.  Just my opinion though :)  ~8', '2007-05-03 13:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610680, 493871, 5112, '<td valign="top">Centred works!!!  ~9</td>', 'Centred works!!!  ~9', '2007-05-03 14:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610681, 504600, 57882, '<td valign="top">This photo really sets the mood.  The lighting is well suited to the subject.  And I also like the color conversion.</td>', 'This photo really sets the mood.  The lighting is well suited to the subject.  And I also like the color conversion.', '2007-05-03 14:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610684, 505077, 76198, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic shot, with beautiful colors and s/he has a great expression... I like the composition with the negative space above.</td>', 'This is a fantastic shot, with beautiful colors and s/he has a great expression... I like the composition with the negative space above.', '2007-05-03 14:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610686, 505619, 76198, '<td valign="top">He''s very pretty! Nice color. I feel it''s a little contrasty, and a little more DOF would be nice.</td>', 'He''s very pretty! Nice color. I feel it''s a little contrasty, and a little more DOF would be nice.', '2007-05-03 14:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610702, 497308, 5112, '<td valign="top">One of the best images of the backside of a bird I''ve seen at DPC :)  ~10</td>', 'One of the best images of the backside of a bird I''ve seen at DPC :)  ~10', '2007-05-03 14:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610703, 500513, 76198, '<td valign="top">I like these minimalistic shots a lot; reminds me of this one <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=501853" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/672/thumb/501853.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/672/thumb/501853.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/672/thumb/501853.jpg"/></a> which was, to my mind, terribly underated in the Rule of Thirds challenge. And magnolias are such beautiful willing subjects. <br/> <br/>That said, this one doesn''t work as well for me; here are my guesses as to why:<br/> <br/>first, the pink doesn''t pop in the same way. It stands out, to be sure, but it somehow doesn''t spin my head around. Not sure why. It may be the darker bckground?<br/> <br/>second, I think having the branch fade out of focus within the frame is very powerful; I think maybe for me the rest of your branch is a little too much in focus which draws my eye away from the bloom.<br/> <br/>A really lovely picure, though, and of a style I wish we saw more of!</td>', 'I like these minimalistic shots a lot; reminds me of this one  which was, to my mind, terribly underated in the Rule of Thirds challenge. And magnolias are such beautiful willing subjects.  That said, this one doesn''t work as well for me; here are my guesses as to why: first, the pink doesn''t pop in the same way. It stands out, to be sure, but it somehow doesn''t spin my head around. Not sure why. It may be the darker bckground? second, I think having the branch fade out of focus within the frame is very powerful; I think maybe for me the rest of your branch is a little too much in focus which draws my eye away from the bloom. A really lovely picure, though, and of a style I wish we saw more of!', '2007-05-03 14:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610709, 505560, 66952, '<td valign="top">awwwww....beautifully done!</td>', 'awwwww....beautifully done!', '2007-05-03 14:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610716, 503400, 76198, '<td valign="top">This is great! Incredible depth, and the light on the skyline is amazing. I''m torn about the shoreline on the right; the framing it adds is nice, but it only covers 1/3 of the edge and to me is a little distracting, if it could have been continued farther up the frame I think that would have helped. <br/> <br/>I say 9. Very nice shot.</td>', 'This is great! Incredible depth, and the light on the skyline is amazing. I''m torn about the shoreline on the right; the framing it adds is nice, but it only covers 1/3 of the edge and to me is a little distracting, if it could have been continued farther up the frame I think that would have helped.  I say 9. Very nice shot.', '2007-05-03 14:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610720, 504454, 76198, '<td valign="top">I''m stunned. This is beautiful. 10. Nothing to add.</td>', 'I''m stunned. This is beautiful. 10. Nothing to add.', '2007-05-03 14:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610726, 494305, 76198, '<td valign="top">You''ve got a nice subject here (as well as a lot of poison ivy?). I like scenes of decay and reclaimation by nature. <br/> <br/>I think this suffers from busyness, however; there''s just soooo much texture it''s hard for the eye to settle. Also the satellite dishes are kind of anachronistic with the "return to nature" think I get out of this shot.</td>', 'You''ve got a nice subject here (as well as a lot of poison ivy?). I like scenes of decay and reclaimation by nature.  I think this suffers from busyness, however; there''s just soooo much texture it''s hard for the eye to settle. Also the satellite dishes are kind of anachronistic with the "return to nature" think I get out of this shot.', '2007-05-03 14:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610739, 496371, 18219, '<td valign="top">this is nearly really good, apart from the blown out sky in the right corner.</td>', 'this is nearly really good, apart from the blown out sky in the right corner.', '2007-05-03 14:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610747, 504162, 5112, '<td valign="top">I love the movement of the feathers, how they are still in the centre, but as you move outwards, they move faster and faster.  Wonderful image - it really conveys the "feel" of not only what peacocks look like, but of how they move.  ~10</td>', 'I love the movement of the feathers, how they are still in the centre, but as you move outwards, they move faster and faster.  Wonderful image - it really conveys the "feel" of not only what peacocks look like, but of how they move.  ~10', '2007-05-03 14:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610750, 504458, 76198, '<td valign="top">Ooh, it''s for sale! Looks like a bad investment. <br/> <br/>Wonderful colors, great sky treatment (is this HDR? must be). The wide-angle effect is always a winner for me, as are scenes of desolation and decay. <br/> <br/>If it were my photo, I''d provide a little more negative space around it, to show the building as small in the hugeness of nature. But that''s my tastes... 9.</td>', 'Ooh, it''s for sale! Looks like a bad investment.  Wonderful colors, great sky treatment (is this HDR? must be). The wide-angle effect is always a winner for me, as are scenes of desolation and decay.  If it were my photo, I''d provide a little more negative space around it, to show the building as small in the hugeness of nature. But that''s my tastes... 9.', '2007-05-03 14:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610754, 504647, 18219, '<td valign="top">that''s some clever photoshopping.<br/>but the image itself doesn''t really do anything for me.<br/>sorry.</td>', 'that''s some clever photoshopping.but the image itself doesn''t really do anything for me.sorry.', '2007-05-03 14:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610756, 497473, 76198, '<td valign="top">Nice color, texture, and tonal depth, I like the angle a lot (diagonals in composition and all). My biggest complaint is that the "aura" be a little softer and more subtle; it would look less "processed" that way. Also I''d continue the dodging clear to the edge of the frame on and around the building...</td>', 'Nice color, texture, and tonal depth, I like the angle a lot (diagonals in composition and all). My biggest complaint is that the "aura" be a little softer and more subtle; it would look less "processed" that way. Also I''d continue the dodging clear to the edge of the frame on and around the building...', '2007-05-03 14:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610759, 505650, 28070, '<td valign="top">My girlfriend has a spot on her arm like that from a vaccination shot. Nice perspective.</td>', 'My girlfriend has a spot on her arm like that from a vaccination shot. Nice perspective.', '2007-05-03 14:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610761, 502244, 52549, '<td valign="top">Excellent! The feeling of movement really comes over. The colours are a dream.</td>', 'Excellent! The feeling of movement really comes over. The colours are a dream.', '2007-05-03 14:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610764, 505444, 76198, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color, great lonely composition.</td>', 'Wonderful color, great lonely composition.', '2007-05-03 14:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610766, 505556, 52549, '<td valign="top">I feel as if I''m looking at a film photo rather than a digital one. Very, very good.</td>', 'I feel as if I''m looking at a film photo rather than a digital one. Very, very good.', '2007-05-03 14:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610772, 504789, 76198, '<td valign="top">"Alas, poor Yorick! I knew him, Horatio; a fellow of infinite jest, of most excellent fancy."<br/> <br/>Nice and creepy!</td>', '"Alas, poor Yorick! I knew him, Horatio; a fellow of infinite jest, of most excellent fancy." Nice and creepy!', '2007-05-03 14:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610773, 505705, 5112, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of banmorn''s work.  I am not a fan of the heavy use of art filters in photography, however, sometimes they are just the right thing do do.  In this case the filter (and whatever else you might have done to clean up the image, if anything) works wonders for the image.  My one nitpick is that it looks ever so slightly tilted to the right (see the edge of the green frame at left, I think I would consider lining it up with the edge of the photo).  ~9</td>', 'This reminds me of banmorn''s work.  I am not a fan of the heavy use of art filters in photography, however, sometimes they are just the right thing do do.  In this case the filter (and whatever else you might have done to clean up the image, if anything) works wonders for the image.  My one nitpick is that it looks ever so slightly tilted to the right (see the edge of the green frame at left, I think I would consider lining it up with the edge of the photo).  ~9', '2007-05-03 14:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610775, 491273, 52549, '<td valign="top">This is my blue ribbon winner! Absolutely excellent.</td>', 'This is my blue ribbon winner! Absolutely excellent.', '2007-05-03 14:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610778, 501670, 52549, '<td valign="top">Crisp and clear and perfect in b/w.</td>', 'Crisp and clear and perfect in b/w.', '2007-05-03 14:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610791, 504573, 52549, '<td valign="top">Great focus. Lovely colours. The only tiny nit-pick I have is the green at the bottom right hand corner. It''s slightly distracting. Good luck.</td>', 'Great focus. Lovely colours. The only tiny nit-pick I have is the green at the bottom right hand corner. It''s slightly distracting. Good luck.', '2007-05-03 14:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610796, 504561, 76198, '<td valign="top">Pros: <br/> <br/>They''re adorable! Hard to beat baby ducks for cuteness. <br/>Color, detail, lighting, all great. <br/>The ripples on the water really communicate the bouncy, frenetic swimming baby ducks are wont to do.<br/> <br/>Cons:<br/> <br/>I''d like a little more space to the right, so the little guys have someplace to swim to! Also (and I almost hate to say it) but the fella at the top left is just a skosh out of focus.</td>', 'Pros:  They''re adorable! Hard to beat baby ducks for cuteness. Color, detail, lighting, all great. The ripples on the water really communicate the bouncy, frenetic swimming baby ducks are wont to do. Cons: I''d like a little more space to the right, so the little guys have someplace to swim to! Also (and I almost hate to say it) but the fella at the top left is just a skosh out of focus.', '2007-05-03 14:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610797, 504937, 52549, '<td valign="top">Great shot. In fact, it''s so good, it could be Yankos work.</td>', 'Great shot. In fact, it''s so good, it could be Yankos work.', '2007-05-03 14:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610804, 491967, 28070, '<td valign="top">I don''t like it.  The blue eye is too much saturated.  The blur is a bit too much making it look like her face isn''t connected to anything although I know it is.  Nice line up across the bottom through the hands and the flower.  My mind tells me her body should be in focus with her face unless she has a really long neck? lol.</td>', 'I don''t like it.  The blue eye is too much saturated.  The blur is a bit too much making it look like her face isn''t connected to anything although I know it is.  Nice line up across the bottom through the hands and the flower.  My mind tells me her body should be in focus with her face unless she has a really long neck? lol.', '2007-05-03 14:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610807, 505710, 5112, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Niiiice!  ~10<br/>Added, obviously you know what you''re doing, but I would consider, just consider, cropping off a little from the bottom (or somehow moving closer or up a bit).  Two reasons, (1) I think I''d like the horizon line a tad lower, and (2) the bottom part, to the left is sort of "messy", whereas the rest of the picture is not, and it draws too much attention.</td>', 'Wow!  Niiiice!  ~10Added, obviously you know what you''re doing, but I would consider, just consider, cropping off a little from the bottom (or somehow moving closer or up a bit).  Two reasons, (1) I think I''d like the horizon line a tad lower, and (2) the bottom part, to the left is sort of "messy", whereas the rest of the picture is not, and it draws too much attention.', '2007-05-03 14:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610811, 504762, 5112, '<td valign="top">Says who?!?!?  Love this image.  I am not entirely sure I like the selective desaturation, although it works in this case.  I''m just wondering here, would a sort of desaturation, where you still keep a bit of colour in the clothing, but not as much colour as you have now, maybe work?  Sort of like a desaturation but then tone down the colours?  I don''t know. ~9</td>', 'Says who?!?!?  Love this image.  I am not entirely sure I like the selective desaturation, although it works in this case.  I''m just wondering here, would a sort of desaturation, where you still keep a bit of colour in the clothing, but not as much colour as you have now, maybe work?  Sort of like a desaturation but then tone down the colours?  I don''t know. ~9', '2007-05-03 14:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610817, 500536, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful candid capture!  This looks like the images that news-services put up for things like "What happened in April".  Lovely.  ~9</td>', 'Beautiful candid capture!  This looks like the images that news-services put up for things like "What happened in April".  Lovely.  ~9', '2007-05-03 14:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610820, 497853, 52549, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful portrait of a beautiful beast. For me (and these are really only my thoughts and not criticism) I would have preferred just to have the eyes in colour. The red nose distracts from the beauty of the rest of the face.</td>', 'This is a beautiful portrait of a beautiful beast. For me (and these are really only my thoughts and not criticism) I would have preferred just to have the eyes in colour. The red nose distracts from the beauty of the rest of the face.', '2007-05-03 14:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
