(3610826, 498207, 52439, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a stunning photograph.<br/>I''ve stared at this for a while, trying to find something, anything i don''t like to try and give a helpful comment, but i can''t.<br/>I don''t say this very often, but, 10, perfect.</td>', 'Wow, what a stunning photograph.I''ve stared at this for a while, trying to find something, anything i don''t like to try and give a helpful comment, but i can''t.I don''t say this very often, but, 10, perfect.', '2007-05-03 14:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610828, 505608, 5112, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, in an "odd" sort of way.  The two lampshades, the curtain backdrop, the old bed/red covers, two almost identical cats covered in a weird throw, the girl and her curious expression.  Funny, but it actually works.  I can see this as a cover for a book, a mystery perhaps.  ~9</td>', 'Interesting image, in an "odd" sort of way.  The two lampshades, the curtain backdrop, the old bed/red covers, two almost identical cats covered in a weird throw, the girl and her curious expression.  Funny, but it actually works.  I can see this as a cover for a book, a mystery perhaps.  ~9', '2007-05-03 14:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
