(3610925, 500556, 76198, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this. The pale greeny tinge in parts is great; the way the seeds seem to just float - amazing. No complaints. 10.</td>', 'I absolutely love this. The pale greeny tinge in parts is great; the way the seeds seem to just float - amazing. No complaints. 10.', '2007-05-03 15:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610937, 493886, 76198, '<td valign="top">Very cool - what''s the lightsource for the mountain/hill there? I might consider editing the star trails back to points, but that''s me.</td>', 'Very cool - what''s the lightsource for the mountain/hill there? I might consider editing the star trails back to points, but that''s me.', '2007-05-03 15:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610941, 492112, 28070, '<td valign="top">Are you a member of team suck?  Sorry I don''t mean to be rude, just a joke hope you laugh too.  Anyway The composition is awful.  I can''t see the whole of either bird so I don''t understand what is happening really.  What birds are fighting.  The one with color looks to be picking around for some food.  And finally the blurry wing.  I''m sorry, I have been voting for a few minutes now and when I look at this photo I just start to laugh, Is that weird? I don''t know, Cheers!  Nice depth of focus though into the background!  The first bird(color) is sharp and contrasts nicely with the out of focus background, I like that part.</td>', 'Are you a member of team suck?  Sorry I don''t mean to be rude, just a joke hope you laugh too.  Anyway The composition is awful.  I can''t see the whole of either bird so I don''t understand what is happening really.  What birds are fighting.  The one with color looks to be picking around for some food.  And finally the blurry wing.  I''m sorry, I have been voting for a few minutes now and when I look at this photo I just start to laugh, Is that weird? I don''t know, Cheers!  Nice depth of focus though into the background!  The first bird(color) is sharp and contrasts nicely with the out of focus background, I like that part.', '2007-05-03 15:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610951, 494785, 28070, '<td valign="top">Wow I can see the little toenails.</td>', 'Wow I can see the little toenails.', '2007-05-03 15:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610964, 504350, 76198, '<td valign="top">what I like:<br/> <br/>This picture has almost a screen print feel, from the posterization. Reminds me of soviet-era artwork, which I''ve always liked. <br/> <br/>But...<br/> <br/>she seems a bit crowded by the composition; she''s looking off screen but there''s not room in front of her. Also I find the branch (an olive branch? could be...) as the brightest thing distracting.</td>', 'what I like: This picture has almost a screen print feel, from the posterization. Reminds me of soviet-era artwork, which I''ve always liked.  But... she seems a bit crowded by the composition; she''s looking off screen but there''s not room in front of her. Also I find the branch (an olive branch? could be...) as the brightest thing distracting.', '2007-05-03 15:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610971, 499787, 76198, '<td valign="top">Rarely do I like this kind of thing - this is one of the times I do. The bright color is jarring, but because it''s just one color it works. Very moody sky. I think of dry storms on the great plains; it looks like rain is needed but it just won''t fall.</td>', 'Rarely do I like this kind of thing - this is one of the times I do. The bright color is jarring, but because it''s just one color it works. Very moody sky. I think of dry storms on the great plains; it looks like rain is needed but it just won''t fall.', '2007-05-03 15:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610976, 503351, 28070, '<td valign="top">Too much sharpening.  The picture looks dead or something.  Was this taken at night with flash?  You need the warm yellow/orange colours of the sun at 30 degree angles to the horizon.  Or the full on bright 90 degree heat blast of the noon into afternoon hours.  Okay basically anytime the sun appears in the sky, take a picture of a flower then.  I guess a flower would not open up at night but it looks like it was night with a flash.  Maybe that just comes back to the contrast as the problem. Cheers!</td>', 'Too much sharpening.  The picture looks dead or something.  Was this taken at night with flash?  You need the warm yellow/orange colours of the sun at 30 degree angles to the horizon.  Or the full on bright 90 degree heat blast of the noon into afternoon hours.  Okay basically anytime the sun appears in the sky, take a picture of a flower then.  I guess a flower would not open up at night but it looks like it was night with a flash.  Maybe that just comes back to the contrast as the problem. Cheers!', '2007-05-03 15:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610979, 504950, 76198, '<td valign="top">Great color and mood, fantastic vignette. It looks almost threatening, which is a very different take on the bridge than one usually sees.</td>', 'Great color and mood, fantastic vignette. It looks almost threatening, which is a very different take on the bridge than one usually sees.', '2007-05-03 15:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610986, 503156, 70, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on shooting in RAW. :)</td>', 'Congratulations on shooting in RAW. :)', '2007-05-03 15:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610988, 504476, 76198, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, nice light and action. I find your choice of crop interesting; it feels unbalanced.</td>', 'Nice shot, nice light and action. I find your choice of crop interesting; it feels unbalanced.', '2007-05-03 15:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610993, 505507, 28070, '<td valign="top">I wonder what this would look like if you distorted it by expanding the vertical to make it more like a 4 by 6 aspect ratio.  I don''t have a wide screen voting booth (lol) so it looks very small on screen while making the rest of the web page stand out more than the photo.</td>', 'I wonder what this would look like if you distorted it by expanding the vertical to make it more like a 4 by 6 aspect ratio.  I don''t have a wide screen voting booth (lol) so it looks very small on screen while making the rest of the web page stand out more than the photo.', '2007-05-03 15:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610994, 500814, 76198, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. 10.</td>', 'Beautiful. 10.', '2007-05-03 15:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
