(3610999, 502687, 63812, '<td valign="top">I love shade and  sunlight behind clouds,and the unusual color of the sky.Make this photo really "menacing".I would like a little more sharpness in the silhouettes.  (9)</td>', 'I love shade and  sunlight behind clouds,and the unusual color of the sky.Make this photo really "menacing".I would like a little more sharpness in the silhouettes.  (9)', '2007-05-03 15:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
