(3611346, 504605, 52439, '<td valign="top">A bad perspective on what looks like a stunning subject. <br/>My main problem with this shot is that you''ve made the subject cut straight through the middle of the shot, which just doesn''t work for me. I think a better angle would have allowed us to see down the falls more.</td>', 'A bad perspective on what looks like a stunning subject. My main problem with this shot is that you''ve made the subject cut straight through the middle of the shot, which just doesn''t work for me. I think a better angle would have allowed us to see down the falls more.', '2007-05-03 17:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
