(3611981, 499328, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice action sequence. My eyes go to the right most panel first which is probably not what you want so maybe make the other panels a little more contrasty so those stood out a little more. The guy''s shirt in the right most panel seems brighter than the others which is why my eyes probably go there first.</td>', 'Nice action sequence. My eyes go to the right most panel first which is probably not what you want so maybe make the other panels a little more contrasty so those stood out a little more. The guy''s shirt in the right most panel seems brighter than the others which is why my eyes probably go there first.', '2007-05-03 20:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
