(3612249, 502856, 41337, '<td valign="top">Kinda interesting how it does look like it''s falling. I think the border would be fine without the attempt to dirty it which doesn''t look too convincing to me.</td>', 'Kinda interesting how it does look like it''s falling. I think the border would be fine without the attempt to dirty it which doesn''t look too convincing to me.', '2007-05-03 21:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
