(3612263, 505321, 40355, '<td valign="top">Interesting mixed shot, but I can''t for the life of me figure out why you cut her face in half on the left side.  I''d have thought at least her forehead down to the bottom of her hands would have been more personal.</td>', 'Interesting mixed shot, but I can''t for the life of me figure out why you cut her face in half on the left side.  I''d have thought at least her forehead down to the bottom of her hands would have been more personal.', '2007-05-03 21:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3612266, 502970, 74979, '<td valign="top">nice kitty....given the title, closer capture of the face and teeth would have had more impact, although those back claws are pretty impressive</td>', 'nice kitty....given the title, closer capture of the face and teeth would have had more impact, although those back claws are pretty impressive', '2007-05-03 21:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3612277, 500006, 5112, '<td valign="top">Wow.  What a fantastic shot.  So many things going on in so many layers, and yet they work well together as a unit.  So Southwest :)  The light is precious.  ~10</td>', 'Wow.  What a fantastic shot.  So many things going on in so many layers, and yet they work well together as a unit.  So Southwest :)  The light is precious.  ~10', '2007-05-03 21:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3612278, 505666, 5112, '<td valign="top">I''d give this an 8, if it wasn''t that I know who you are, oh great photographer of sisters :)  8 because it is really well done, without being a setup or all gimmicky.  Not higher than 8, because even though it is well done, it is still a fairly standard image, and I have to have room at the top, right?</td>', 'I''d give this an 8, if it wasn''t that I know who you are, oh great photographer of sisters :)  8 because it is really well done, without being a setup or all gimmicky.  Not higher than 8, because even though it is well done, it is still a fairly standard image, and I have to have room at the top, right?', '2007-05-03 21:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
