(3612291, 505611, 74979, '<td valign="top">the background seems more glare than pleasing boke...I love the subject''s color &amp; clarity..nice DOF, just less sunshine, or less background (tighter crop?)I think</td>', 'the background seems more glare than pleasing boke...I love the subject''s color & clarity..nice DOF, just less sunshine, or less background (tighter crop?)I think', '2007-05-03 21:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
