(3613262, 496604, 76198, '<td valign="top">This shot did little for me, until I saw the person on the cliff - for some reason that totally won me over. It softens and makes accessible an otherwise very forbidding coast.<br/> <br/>I do think some work with cuves would help to make the colors pop a bit more; it seems almost hazy. But a very nice "man''s place in nature" shot.</td>', 'This shot did little for me, until I saw the person on the cliff - for some reason that totally won me over. It softens and makes accessible an otherwise very forbidding coast. I do think some work with cuves would help to make the colors pop a bit more; it seems almost hazy. But a very nice "man''s place in nature" shot.', '2007-05-04 01:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
