(3615262, 504561, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very cute, great colours and clarity.</td>', 'Very cute, great colours and clarity.', '2007-05-04 15:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615264, 505497, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition, amazing colours.</td>', 'Wonderful composition, amazing colours.', '2007-05-04 15:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615266, 505467, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wonderful clarity and colours. White spot might be a tad bright.</td>', 'Wonderful clarity and colours. White spot might be a tad bright.', '2007-05-04 15:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615279, 496152, 68256, '<td valign="top">Wow that is good...there isn''t a single thing that can be said to make it better.  Lighting is perfect, composition too...This flows so well it is unbelievable.  I hope to see it on page 1.  10</td>', 'Wow that is good...there isn''t a single thing that can be said to make it better.  Lighting is perfect, composition too...This flows so well it is unbelievable.  I hope to see it on page 1.  10', '2007-05-04 15:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615289, 503955, 68256, '<td valign="top">Since this is expert I think it would have been perfectly fine to clone out the branches on the left and right side.  Other tan that, I like it. I really like the gradient of the sky and great contrast.</td>', 'Since this is expert I think it would have been perfectly fine to clone out the branches on the left and right side.  Other tan that, I like it. I really like the gradient of the sky and great contrast.', '2007-05-04 15:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615297, 505636, 68256, '<td valign="top">You have captured a great mood here....it is both real and surreal which really adds tons of interest.  Great job.</td>', 'You have captured a great mood here....it is both real and surreal which really adds tons of interest.  Great job.', '2007-05-04 15:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615303, 497252, 51900, '<td valign="top">use a polarizer. there''s way to much reflection</td>', 'use a polarizer. there''s way to much reflection', '2007-05-04 15:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615309, 501778, 74559, '<td valign="top">Very convincing processing, I really like it!</td>', 'Very convincing processing, I really like it!', '2007-05-04 15:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615311, 494817, 51900, '<td valign="top">eerie. where''d u find this?</td>', 'eerie. where''d u find this?', '2007-05-04 15:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615329, 504434, 68256, '<td valign="top">Ok, I just gave a 10 and a favorite to a shot sorta like this....did you have a partner with you that day? LOL  Anyway, I can''t decide which one I like better, this one or the other.  Either way they both get a 10 from me.  I think I like the other one just a tad better because of the overall "happier" exposure.  If that makes any since.  I love your stream of light though!  Great shooting and good luck.  It will be cool if they both make the first page.</td>', 'Ok, I just gave a 10 and a favorite to a shot sorta like this....did you have a partner with you that day? LOL  Anyway, I can''t decide which one I like better, this one or the other.  Either way they both get a 10 from me.  I think I like the other one just a tad better because of the overall "happier" exposure.  If that makes any since.  I love your stream of light though!  Great shooting and good luck.  It will be cool if they both make the first page.', '2007-05-04 15:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615338, 494756, 68256, '<td valign="top">This would have been perfect IMHO if the bird had more space to walk into..ie flipped.  9</td>', 'This would have been perfect IMHO if the bird had more space to walk into..ie flipped.  9', '2007-05-04 15:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615348, 504647, 68256, '<td valign="top">So imaginative and well executed.  To me this is what expert editing is all about.  You have created a wonderful composition.</td>', 'So imaginative and well executed.  To me this is what expert editing is all about.  You have created a wonderful composition.', '2007-05-04 15:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615350, 501411, 51900, '<td valign="top">now that''s art</td>', 'now that''s art', '2007-05-04 15:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615364, 505279, 51900, '<td valign="top">the moon makes the shot</td>', 'the moon makes the shot', '2007-05-04 15:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615381, 505347, 68256, '<td valign="top">I love the tone of this and the lines. I also like the vignetting.  Maybe a suggestion would be to clone out the smaller cable on the top left although it might look better just how you have it.  If there were no land on the horizon and thus a little "cleaner" I would have given it a 10.  It is a beautiful capture and a 9 for me.</td>', 'I love the tone of this and the lines. I also like the vignetting.  Maybe a suggestion would be to clone out the smaller cable on the top left although it might look better just how you have it.  If there were no land on the horizon and thus a little "cleaner" I would have given it a 10.  It is a beautiful capture and a 9 for me.', '2007-05-04 15:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615383, 504792, 71951, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, great colors.</td>', 'Beautiful photo, great colors.', '2007-05-04 15:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615390, 494256, 51900, '<td valign="top">trippy perspective. i don''t know exactl where u''re shooting from, or what i''m looking at, but it seems natural. it''s like a dream, sorta<br/> <br/>10</td>', 'trippy perspective. i don''t know exactl where u''re shooting from, or what i''m looking at, but it seems natural. it''s like a dream, sorta 10', '2007-05-04 15:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615404, 503939, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I gave you a 10 a couple of days ago and am just now getting around to commenting on a few.  I love the overall tone and bright spots of the barn.  Everything fits beautifully.</td>', 'Very nice!  I gave you a 10 a couple of days ago and am just now getting around to commenting on a few.  I love the overall tone and bright spots of the barn.  Everything fits beautifully.', '2007-05-04 15:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615411, 504237, 68256, '<td valign="top">I love the layering and implied s-curve.  I also like the symmetry and overall tone.  Great composition too.  The one grean leafed understory plant kinda distracts a little from an otherwise perfectly clean photo.  Anyway, that isn''t enough to bring the vote down below 10.</td>', 'I love the layering and implied s-curve.  I also like the symmetry and overall tone.  Great composition too.  The one grean leafed understory plant kinda distracts a little from an otherwise perfectly clean photo.  Anyway, that isn''t enough to bring the vote down below 10.', '2007-05-04 15:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615415, 504268, 68256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo and deserving of a big wall somewhere so it can be appreciated!  10</td>', 'Beautiful photo and deserving of a big wall somewhere so it can be appreciated!  10', '2007-05-04 16:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615416, 505575, 36619, '<td valign="top">wow! nice one, really surreal!</td>', 'wow! nice one, really surreal!', '2007-05-04 16:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615446, 504647, 60698, '<td valign="top">This is fabulous! I tried this technique and can''t imagine how hard it was to get the water droplets right!</td>', 'This is fabulous! I tried this technique and can''t imagine how hard it was to get the water droplets right!', '2007-05-04 16:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615460, 502867, 40718, '<td valign="top">is the dirty hand on purpose or accident?  If it''s on purpose it''s not done well enough to convey the point.  She''s a cutie though. 6</td>', 'is the dirty hand on purpose or accident?  If it''s on purpose it''s not done well enough to convey the point.  She''s a cutie though. 6', '2007-05-04 16:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615484, 504301, 11920, '<td valign="top">I''m giving you a 10</td>', 'I''m giving you a 10', '2007-05-04 16:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615492, 502565, 36619, '<td valign="top">love this one. nostalic&amp; lovely.</td>', 'love this one. nostalic& lovely.', '2007-05-04 16:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615499, 496962, 41794, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic! It looks like an old time carnival and the nostalgia just oozes out of the picture. I love how bright the lights are not just themselves but even in the water reflections against the darkness of the sky and the pavement. In my very humble opinion this should be a ribbon for you!</td>', 'This is fantastic! It looks like an old time carnival and the nostalgia just oozes out of the picture. I love how bright the lights are not just themselves but even in the water reflections against the darkness of the sky and the pavement. In my very humble opinion this should be a ribbon for you!', '2007-05-04 16:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615511, 505467, 40718, '<td valign="top">The PP is very nice here.  Great shot.  I had thought about doing a ladybug macro for an upcoming challenge, but I think I''ll wait a bit after this one... ;) 9<br/> <br/>When I take a long look, the leg position makes me wonder if this isn''t shot "down" meaning the bug is really on its side compared to the ground.  Expert editing also makes you wonder if its a composite, but I sense not.</td>', 'The PP is very nice here.  Great shot.  I had thought about doing a ladybug macro for an upcoming challenge, but I think I''ll wait a bit after this one... ;) 9 When I take a long look, the leg position makes me wonder if this isn''t shot "down" meaning the bug is really on its side compared to the ground.  Expert editing also makes you wonder if its a composite, but I sense not.', '2007-05-04 16:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615513, 498043, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great kitty shot - love the color behind the screen as it serves well to highlight the eyes.</td>', 'Great kitty shot - love the color behind the screen as it serves well to highlight the eyes.', '2007-05-04 16:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615517, 495496, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the foreground and the three buildings and trees - sky seems a tad wonky.</td>', 'Love the foreground and the three buildings and trees - sky seems a tad wonky.', '2007-05-04 16:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615539, 496152, 52713, '<td valign="top">another cave shot, this is getting as common as Northen Lights photos!<br/> <br/>;-)<br/> <br/>Nice job!</td>', 'another cave shot, this is getting as common as Northen Lights photos! ;-) Nice job!', '2007-05-04 16:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615541, 503802, 7743, '<td valign="top">This just looks plain weird.  Cool, but weird.</td>', 'This just looks plain weird.  Cool, but weird.', '2007-05-04 16:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615561, 505253, 30049, '<td valign="top">I think this is a lovely piece of work overall.  The bottom right photo seems a little redundant but works better than trying to only incorporate three images in this.  One of my higher picks for this challenge.  Good luck.</td>', 'I think this is a lovely piece of work overall.  The bottom right photo seems a little redundant but works better than trying to only incorporate three images in this.  One of my higher picks for this challenge.  Good luck.', '2007-05-04 16:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615569, 505588, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like how the 3 tulips stand out from the others.  Adds interest and keeps what could easily be a static image from being stale.  Very good color, and the technicals are right on.  Good luck in the challenge.<br/> <br/>Remind me after the challenge - one of the stock sites I belong to (not a micro) has a job request for tulips right now.  It''s paying out $50 if your image is used.</td>', 'I like how the 3 tulips stand out from the others.  Adds interest and keeps what could easily be a static image from being stale.  Very good color, and the technicals are right on.  Good luck in the challenge. Remind me after the challenge - one of the stock sites I belong to (not a micro) has a job request for tulips right now.  It''s paying out $50 if your image is used.', '2007-05-04 16:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615578, 496490, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo with a title that fits.  Very nice control of DOF to keep the bridge lines in the background but minimize their distraction.  The dappled lighting (filtered thru trees I''m guessing) keeps this image in control (like a natural PP burn).  :)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful photo with a title that fits.  Very nice control of DOF to keep the bridge lines in the background but minimize their distraction.  The dappled lighting (filtered thru trees I''m guessing) keeps this image in control (like a natural PP burn).  :)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-05-04 16:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615589, 505255, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful story being told here.  I want to look at the side statues, but at the same time I keep coming back to the light and the person walking down the center.  Great control of what could be some tricky exposure here.  Nicely done!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful story being told here.  I want to look at the side statues, but at the same time I keep coming back to the light and the person walking down the center.  Great control of what could be some tricky exposure here.  Nicely done!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-05-04 16:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615601, 501997, 7969, '<td valign="top">this is a nice shot but I think would be stronger with only the palms and the ''rounder trees'' on right cropped out</td>', 'this is a nice shot but I think would be stronger with only the palms and the ''rounder trees'' on right cropped out', '2007-05-04 16:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615616, 504116, 61651, '<td valign="top">What a great perspective, and not one I think most people would think "picture worthy" -  good eye.  Lively colors and the bends in the webbing give this such a dynamic feel.</td>', 'What a great perspective, and not one I think most people would think "picture worthy" -  good eye.  Lively colors and the bends in the webbing give this such a dynamic feel.', '2007-05-04 16:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615618, 502564, 61651, '<td valign="top">Stark and troubling - I really like what you''ve done here.  Fantastic shot.</td>', 'Stark and troubling - I really like what you''ve done here.  Fantastic shot.', '2007-05-04 16:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615621, 503158, 61651, '<td valign="top">Wow, if this is what you *didn''t* enter in triptych I can''t wait to see what you did enter!  Dynamic framing, fantastic captures, excellent arrangement.</td>', 'Wow, if this is what you *didn''t* enter in triptych I can''t wait to see what you did enter!  Dynamic framing, fantastic captures, excellent arrangement.', '2007-05-04 17:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615623, 500814, 61651, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is just great - I am so impressed.  Great framing, highly amusing title/image link.</td>', 'Oh, this is just great - I am so impressed.  Great framing, highly amusing title/image link.', '2007-05-04 17:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615627, 505279, 61651, '<td valign="top">The perspective and color contrasts are very striking, this is definitely a photo that gets noticed.  The edges all seem a bit jaggy on my monitor though, which suggests too much sharpening?  Great effort - 7.</td>', 'The perspective and color contrasts are very striking, this is definitely a photo that gets noticed.  The edges all seem a bit jaggy on my monitor though, which suggests too much sharpening?  Great effort - 7.', '2007-05-04 17:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615629, 505560, 61651, '<td valign="top">This is such an unexpected visual and so very nicely done.  Looks like a painting by a Dutch Master.  I love it.</td>', 'This is such an unexpected visual and so very nicely done.  Looks like a painting by a Dutch Master.  I love it.', '2007-05-04 17:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615633, 505622, 61651, '<td valign="top">Wow - very disturbing.  A powerful depiction of self-hatred. An impressive work of art.</td>', 'Wow - very disturbing.  A powerful depiction of self-hatred. An impressive work of art.', '2007-05-04 17:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615639, 501379, 61651, '<td valign="top">Ever get the feeling that someone''s watching you?  What a great composition - I might have tried cloning out the two lights at the bottom left to keep them from distracting from the main focal point, but this is nevertheless an arresting abstract.</td>', 'Ever get the feeling that someone''s watching you?  What a great composition - I might have tried cloning out the two lights at the bottom left to keep them from distracting from the main focal point, but this is nevertheless an arresting abstract.', '2007-05-04 17:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615641, 505705, 70000, '<td valign="top">Wow the colors are so vibrant! great range of colors. cute</td>', 'Wow the colors are so vibrant! great range of colors. cute', '2007-05-04 17:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615642, 502856, 70000, '<td valign="top">What a cool reflection! its got a really cool angle that gives the picture a off balance kind of feel</td>', 'What a cool reflection! its got a really cool angle that gives the picture a off balance kind of feel', '2007-05-04 17:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615645, 503355, 70000, '<td valign="top">I think this could use just a touch more contrast</td>', 'I think this could use just a touch more contrast', '2007-05-04 17:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615651, 505655, 61651, '<td valign="top">Tremendous title, a great Where''s Waldo picture, makes you look and look again.  Like the varied undulations of the landscape, the tonal range, the hidden surprise in the (almost) center. Great.</td>', 'Tremendous title, a great Where''s Waldo picture, makes you look and look again.  Like the varied undulations of the landscape, the tonal range, the hidden surprise in the (almost) center. Great.', '2007-05-04 17:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615660, 500556, 68956, '<td valign="top">I''m intrigued how you got the centre so light in what is usually an opaque part of the plant. A lovely image with just the right DOF :)</td>', 'I''m intrigued how you got the centre so light in what is usually an opaque part of the plant. A lovely image with just the right DOF :)', '2007-05-04 17:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615664, 505363, 68956, '<td valign="top">Good PP which has only enhanced this lovely image.</td>', 'Good PP which has only enhanced this lovely image.', '2007-05-04 17:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615665, 496443, 68956, '<td valign="top">There''s a real warmth and homeliness in this image:)</td>', 'There''s a real warmth and homeliness in this image:)', '2007-05-04 17:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615667, 503791, 68956, '<td valign="top">Good, arresting image. Love the negative space ;)</td>', 'Good, arresting image. Love the negative space ;)', '2007-05-04 17:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615672, 505602, 68956, '<td valign="top">Good image with good PP, maybe a few jaggies in there, could just be the image size.</td>', 'Good image with good PP, maybe a few jaggies in there, could just be the image size.', '2007-05-04 17:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615673, 505253, 68956, '<td valign="top">I love the light on that main wave. Excellent triptych.</td>', 'I love the light on that main wave. Excellent triptych.', '2007-05-04 17:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615675, 503122, 68956, '<td valign="top">Good graphic image :)</td>', 'Good graphic image :)', '2007-05-04 17:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615678, 500814, 68956, '<td valign="top">Something very magical about this image, lovely capture.</td>', 'Something very magical about this image, lovely capture.', '2007-05-04 17:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615679, 493669, 68956, '<td valign="top">Well observed and captured.</td>', 'Well observed and captured.', '2007-05-04 17:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615680, 505171, 68956, '<td valign="top">Good vibrant colours.</td>', 'Good vibrant colours.', '2007-05-04 17:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615684, 505258, 68956, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture with great detail.</td>', 'Excellent capture with great detail.', '2007-05-04 17:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615685, 504792, 68956, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured a really ethereal scene there. Lovely.</td>', 'You''ve captured a really ethereal scene there. Lovely.', '2007-05-04 17:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615724, 505564, 52500, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  I had the same idea around the middle of the month, but I never got the chance to get to a good location.  This is a perfect spot for this effect.</td>', 'Very nicely done.  I had the same idea around the middle of the month, but I never got the chance to get to a good location.  This is a perfect spot for this effect.', '2007-05-04 17:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615750, 496635, 69684, '<td valign="top">In my opinion you have to choose. Or the singer, or the man with the sigaret. I think both is too much.</td>', 'In my opinion you have to choose. Or the singer, or the man with the sigaret. I think both is too much.', '2007-05-04 18:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615757, 500060, 69684, '<td valign="top">Just a little more DOF would make this photo more interesting!</td>', 'Just a little more DOF would make this photo more interesting!', '2007-05-04 18:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615774, 505389, 69684, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, but there should be more contrast. The blacks are not really black, the whites could be whiter.</td>', 'I like the photo, but there should be more contrast. The blacks are not really black, the whites could be whiter.', '2007-05-04 18:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615816, 493603, 69725, '<td valign="top">I really like this. I usually don''t like blurred photos, but this one makes me feel part of the image, like I''m there. Definitely a 10, for me. Good job.</td>', 'I really like this. I usually don''t like blurred photos, but this one makes me feel part of the image, like I''m there. Definitely a 10, for me. Good job.', '2007-05-04 18:29:52.000000', NULL, 1);
