(3619206, 501385, 32147, '<td valign="top">oh man...  this is a shot with great promise.  Excellent choice of location and good timing on the exposure.  Post processing looks great.  I only wish that the vehicle was closer to the camera.  <br/> <br/>I have done a lot of work shooting cars and my gut feeling tells me that this would look best with the car in the left foreground.  Perhaps placing it at the left bottom intersection of 3rds gridlines.  Granted, that might require a bit of fill flash or reflector on the car''s right side (the side away from the fading sunlight).</td>', 'oh man...  this is a shot with great promise.  Excellent choice of location and good timing on the exposure.  Post processing looks great.  I only wish that the vehicle was closer to the camera.   I have done a lot of work shooting cars and my gut feeling tells me that this would look best with the car in the left foreground.  Perhaps placing it at the left bottom intersection of 3rds gridlines.  Granted, that might require a bit of fill flash or reflector on the car''s right side (the side away from the fading sunlight).', '2007-05-05 22:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
