(3620376, 505087, 52439, '<td valign="top">A bit underexposed, it''s a very difficult subject to focus properly, and while i think you managed that bit the stems coming out of the centre block where you''ve focused, making it look like you mis-focused.<br/>Ok i''m pretty sure not of that made any sense.<br/>Sorry, i know what i mean, just my keyboard doesn''t.</td>', 'A bit underexposed, it''s a very difficult subject to focus properly, and while i think you managed that bit the stems coming out of the centre block where you''ve focused, making it look like you mis-focused.Ok i''m pretty sure not of that made any sense.Sorry, i know what i mean, just my keyboard doesn''t.', '2007-05-06 11:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
