(3620384, 504864, 52439, '<td valign="top">While the subject does nothing for me, i think the heavy post processing, of the eyes especially has ruined the main focal point.</td>', 'While the subject does nothing for me, i think the heavy post processing, of the eyes especially has ruined the main focal point.', '2007-05-06 11:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620386, 505467, 77958, '<td valign="top">Love the contrasting red and yellow tones as well as the overall composition - especially the leading line from the upper left to the lower right.  I suspect the ladybug was placed in the image post edit, but unfortunately the composite image isn''t entirely realistic - perhaps some very subtle drop shadows under the ends of the legs?</td>', 'Love the contrasting red and yellow tones as well as the overall composition - especially the leading line from the upper left to the lower right.  I suspect the ladybug was placed in the image post edit, but unfortunately the composite image isn''t entirely realistic - perhaps some very subtle drop shadows under the ends of the legs?', '2007-05-06 11:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620389, 504458, 52439, '<td valign="top">While you can still tell it''s HDR, it is more sublte than most of the examples posted on DPC.<br/> <br/>I think the ultimate use of PP is when you can''t tell that they have been used.</td>', 'While you can still tell it''s HDR, it is more sublte than most of the examples posted on DPC. I think the ultimate use of PP is when you can''t tell that they have been used.', '2007-05-06 11:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
