(3620713, 494756, 63269, '<td valign="top">Lovely! The subtle lighting, and the  colors are beautiful.  You''ve captured the grace of this bird very well.</td>', 'Lovely! The subtle lighting, and the  colors are beautiful.  You''ve captured the grace of this bird very well.', '2007-05-06 14:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620716, 505321, 63269, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition...I like how you used the colors of the couch to your advantage. Nice lighting and focus!</td>', 'Interesting composition...I like how you used the colors of the couch to your advantage. Nice lighting and focus!', '2007-05-06 14:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620722, 500494, 63269, '<td valign="top">Pretty!  It might be better if you changed the composition around a bit - and maybe had the feather to the side instead of straight on in the center. Also the lighitng could be a little brighter. But otherwise this is really pretty - your focus is PERFECT!</td>', 'Pretty!  It might be better if you changed the composition around a bit - and maybe had the feather to the side instead of straight on in the center. Also the lighitng could be a little brighter. But otherwise this is really pretty - your focus is PERFECT!', '2007-05-06 14:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620723, 504550, 63269, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting - cool shot!</td>', 'Interesting lighting - cool shot!', '2007-05-06 14:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620733, 493940, 63269, '<td valign="top">BRILLIANT!! This is <i>very </i> lovely! The colors are so vibrant and full of life. They are smooth and pretty... and the shallow DOF and composition are excelent, the details wonderful.  The color harmony you have - with the way the butterfuly almost matches the background, and yet is half on the green leaf is perfect. A very sweet shot. Nice job!</td>', 'BRILLIANT!! This is very  lovely! The colors are so vibrant and full of life. They are smooth and pretty... and the shallow DOF and composition are excelent, the details wonderful.  The color harmony you have - with the way the butterfuly almost matches the background, and yet is half on the green leaf is perfect. A very sweet shot. Nice job!', '2007-05-06 14:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620734, 505219, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very awesome capture! The composition is also great, and the colors beautiful.</td>', 'Very awesome capture! The composition is also great, and the colors beautiful.', '2007-05-06 14:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620737, 503282, 70107, '<td valign="top">Winner right here, and if not, damn close to it.<br/>10</td>', 'Winner right here, and if not, damn close to it.10', '2007-05-06 14:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620738, 505336, 63269, '<td valign="top">Way too cool! First of all, I love the border, it''s perfect. This is such a neat texture study - I really like your choice of color, and the high contrast. Very awesome shot!</td>', 'Way too cool! First of all, I love the border, it''s perfect. This is such a neat texture study - I really like your choice of color, and the high contrast. Very awesome shot!', '2007-05-06 14:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620744, 505607, 63269, '<td valign="top">Perfect details - you have great focus! IMO this would be an even more awesome shot if the composition was a little different - specifically, if the dragonfly''s body wasn''t in the direct center. But other than that - excellent shot!</td>', 'Perfect details - you have great focus! IMO this would be an even more awesome shot if the composition was a little different - specifically, if the dragonfly''s body wasn''t in the direct center. But other than that - excellent shot!', '2007-05-06 14:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620747, 494256, 63269, '<td valign="top">Cool! I can hardly believe that''s the sky - it''s so dramatic and dark it''s almost black! Great shot.</td>', 'Cool! I can hardly believe that''s the sky - it''s so dramatic and dark it''s almost black! Great shot.', '2007-05-06 14:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
