(3620757, 504785, 63269, '<td valign="top">REALLY cool idea!! I love the selective desaturation. However, I almost feel like I want to get closer to the butterfly, or see more detail of it. A slightly different or closer POV would have been awesome! Very cool shot though. Nice job!</td>', 'REALLY cool idea!! I love the selective desaturation. However, I almost feel like I want to get closer to the butterfly, or see more detail of it. A slightly different or closer POV would have been awesome! Very cool shot though. Nice job!', '2007-05-06 14:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
