(3620769, 501767, 63269, '<td valign="top">THis is a classy shot - something about the dull gray sky almost adds to this photo... amazing!  Very good job. It might be cool to see this in black and white, or even sepia. But the color is pretty though.  :)</td>', 'THis is a classy shot - something about the dull gray sky almost adds to this photo... amazing!  Very good job. It might be cool to see this in black and white, or even sepia. But the color is pretty though.  :)', '2007-05-06 14:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
