(3620795, 500948, 63269, '<td valign="top">Well...I was a little confused at first, and it took me a minute to figure out what this was. I think the moon is much to large, and since it''s so bright, and everything else so dark, it makes things really confusing. But I really love these kind of images! With contrasts between deep shadows, illuminted blues and greens, and then some scatterings of shining bightness. Lovely! Excellent try.</td>', 'Well...I was a little confused at first, and it took me a minute to figure out what this was. I think the moon is much to large, and since it''s so bright, and everything else so dark, it makes things really confusing. But I really love these kind of images! With contrasts between deep shadows, illuminted blues and greens, and then some scatterings of shining bightness. Lovely! Excellent try.', '2007-05-06 14:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620800, 502344, 63269, '<td valign="top">Totally breath-taking. Fantastic.  Epic.  The contrasts here are just fabulous - I love it!</td>', 'Totally breath-taking. Fantastic.  Epic.  The contrasts here are just fabulous - I love it!', '2007-05-06 14:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620812, 503122, 63269, '<td valign="top">OOOOHHHHHH!! I would absolutely LOVE to see this withought the border (or with only a smaller black one) and in a bigger size. But I''m just being picky! :) This is SOOOO beautiful! I absolutely love the vivid colors against the deep blacks, and the way the smooth elements contrast with the sharper more detailed objects. If it weren''t for the border... but this still is an amazing image! It evokes such a neat atmosphere. :)</td>', 'OOOOHHHHHH!! I would absolutely LOVE to see this withought the border (or with only a smaller black one) and in a bigger size. But I''m just being picky! :) This is SOOOO beautiful! I absolutely love the vivid colors against the deep blacks, and the way the smooth elements contrast with the sharper more detailed objects. If it weren''t for the border... but this still is an amazing image! It evokes such a neat atmosphere. :)', '2007-05-06 14:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
