(3620821, 505639, 63269, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love the liquid gold reflections on the water! They''re perfect - the water is just right, not to choppy and nice and smooth. you''ve created a very beautiful image here - lovely job!</td>', 'I absolutely love the liquid gold reflections on the water! They''re perfect - the water is just right, not to choppy and nice and smooth. you''ve created a very beautiful image here - lovely job!', '2007-05-06 14:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
