(3621336, 504237, 60047, '<td valign="top">What a striking photograph. You''ve really captured the vivid spring greens along with the darkness of the trees and the softness of the blues. Quite a magical place.</td>', 'What a striking photograph. You''ve really captured the vivid spring greens along with the darkness of the trees and the softness of the blues. Quite a magical place.', '2007-05-06 18:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3621338, 502244, 60047, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lines, colors and contrast.</td>', 'Beautiful lines, colors and contrast.', '2007-05-06 18:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3621364, 504403, 60047, '<td valign="top">We see a lot of flowers here on DPC - this one here is noticeable for the way it appears to have an inner glow and you have managed to keep most of it in the lens'' DOF. It is more of a soft and muted presentation rather than the sock-you-in-the-eyes-with-color presentation. Well done.</td>', 'We see a lot of flowers here on DPC - this one here is noticeable for the way it appears to have an inner glow and you have managed to keep most of it in the lens'' DOF. It is more of a soft and muted presentation rather than the sock-you-in-the-eyes-with-color presentation. Well done.', '2007-05-06 18:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3621383, 503876, 61651, '<td valign="top">I think this is a lovely portrait - complementary coloring, the background is nice, and the pose is non-standard and holds a viewer''s interest.  Great job!</td>', 'I think this is a lovely portrait - complementary coloring, the background is nice, and the pose is non-standard and holds a viewer''s interest.  Great job!', '2007-05-06 18:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3621390, 502907, 61651, '<td valign="top">This a cool perspective, I like this very much.  Wish the left-hand side of the frog was in better focus, but you can''t have everything. :)</td>', 'This a cool perspective, I like this very much.  Wish the left-hand side of the frog was in better focus, but you can''t have everything. :)', '2007-05-06 18:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3621395, 500513, 61651, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, and I like how you composed it in the frame.</td>', 'Very pretty, and I like how you composed it in the frame.', '2007-05-06 18:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3621398, 505505, 61651, '<td valign="top">Great sharp subject and lovely bokeh.  Composition is very nice too.  Every time I look at this I like it more and more - I gave this a 9, but bumping to a 10 - one of my favorites in the challenge.</td>', 'Great sharp subject and lovely bokeh.  Composition is very nice too.  Every time I look at this I like it more and more - I gave this a 9, but bumping to a 10 - one of my favorites in the challenge.', '2007-05-06 18:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3621410, 504454, 61651, '<td valign="top">Wonderful abstract quality and I like how the background rocks fade into soft pastel shades.  The glare at the bottom right may be a bit of a detraction I suppose from a technical perspective (especially as it obscures the circle at that point and breaks the continuity), but I personally don''t mind it much.</td>', 'Wonderful abstract quality and I like how the background rocks fade into soft pastel shades.  The glare at the bottom right may be a bit of a detraction I suppose from a technical perspective (especially as it obscures the circle at that point and breaks the continuity), but I personally don''t mind it much.', '2007-05-06 18:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3621414, 505077, 61651, '<td valign="top">Great capture - such a direct gaze.  And I like how you placed your subject in the frame.</td>', 'Great capture - such a direct gaze.  And I like how you placed your subject in the frame.', '2007-05-06 18:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3621420, 497661, 61651, '<td valign="top">Very painterly, and I like how the bird is over-saturated and stands out well against the relatively bleak-looking background.</td>', 'Very painterly, and I like how the bird is over-saturated and stands out well against the relatively bleak-looking background.', '2007-05-06 18:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3621428, 505639, 61651, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous showcasing of the water and shot at a good angle.</td>', 'Gorgeous showcasing of the water and shot at a good angle.', '2007-05-06 18:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3621431, 505252, 61651, '<td valign="top">I like how you processed this so she stands out so starkly against her environment.</td>', 'I like how you processed this so she stands out so starkly against her environment.', '2007-05-06 18:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3621437, 493643, 61651, '<td valign="top">Great abstract - maybe you could tweak the saturation a bit more to make it more striking, but it''s IMO just fine as it is too.</td>', 'Great abstract - maybe you could tweak the saturation a bit more to make it more striking, but it''s IMO just fine as it is too.', '2007-05-06 18:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3621442, 500556, 61651, '<td valign="top">I like the offset composition and how you got in really close here, closer than other shots like this.</td>', 'I like the offset composition and how you got in really close here, closer than other shots like this.', '2007-05-06 18:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3621447, 505674, 61651, '<td valign="top">So much energy and imminent danger expressed in this image - great capture.</td>', 'So much energy and imminent danger expressed in this image - great capture.', '2007-05-06 18:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3621454, 505731, 61651, '<td valign="top">Great job on the focus - I like the simple structure of this composition.</td>', 'Great job on the focus - I like the simple structure of this composition.', '2007-05-06 18:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3621463, 495754, 61651, '<td valign="top">Very cool perspective - glad you resisted the urge to go to the top of the hill and get a picture of the trees from top to bottom - truncating them this way forces me to "see" the rest of them myself, and that makes this image so much more engaging to look at.</td>', 'Very cool perspective - glad you resisted the urge to go to the top of the hill and get a picture of the trees from top to bottom - truncating them this way forces me to "see" the rest of them myself, and that makes this image so much more engaging to look at.', '2007-05-06 18:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3621465, 504557, 61651, '<td valign="top">Very dreamlike.  I assume this is some sort of composite - I like the complementary colors.</td>', 'Very dreamlike.  I assume this is some sort of composite - I like the complementary colors.', '2007-05-06 18:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3621468, 497490, 61651, '<td valign="top">I like how you made the high contrast work for you here - very edgy image, has its own "atmosphere" even.</td>', 'I like how you made the high contrast work for you here - very edgy image, has its own "atmosphere" even.', '2007-05-06 18:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3621469, 501018, 61651, '<td valign="top">Very funny idea, and I like how you set it all up.  Model pose is just right.</td>', 'Very funny idea, and I like how you set it all up.  Model pose is just right.', '2007-05-06 18:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3621471, 505352, 61651, '<td valign="top">Very zen - I like it.</td>', 'Very zen - I like it.', '2007-05-06 18:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3621473, 496886, 61651, '<td valign="top">Great shot and good idea to match the gestures of both subjects.</td>', 'Great shot and good idea to match the gestures of both subjects.', '2007-05-06 18:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3621475, 505178, 61651, '<td valign="top">Whether you got this mostly in-camera or mostly pp''ed it, it''s a great shot IMO either way - but if you got this in-camera you must have died and went to heaven when you realized what you got. :)  Lovely.</td>', 'Whether you got this mostly in-camera or mostly pp''ed it, it''s a great shot IMO either way - but if you got this in-camera you must have died and went to heaven when you realized what you got. :)  Lovely.', '2007-05-06 18:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3621478, 497107, 61651, '<td valign="top">What lovely texture you captured here.</td>', 'What lovely texture you captured here.', '2007-05-06 18:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3621564, 494049, 64446, '<td valign="top">Too Out of focus and granular for my taste.</td>', 'Too Out of focus and granular for my taste.', '2007-05-06 19:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3621570, 500006, 64446, '<td valign="top">Interesting montage..</td>', 'Interesting montage..', '2007-05-06 19:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
