(3624458, 496795, 77819, '<td valign="top">odd, but nice!  Makes me cold just looking at it.</td>', 'odd, but nice!  Makes me cold just looking at it.', '2007-05-07 13:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624463, 503354, 63269, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a fantasy! Very awesome. I love how subtle the colors and lighting are in the front of the shot.</td>', 'Reminds me of a fantasy! Very awesome. I love how subtle the colors and lighting are in the front of the shot.', '2007-05-07 13:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624466, 503306, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love how there are simple tones contrasted against vibrant colors - it''s a really unique and interesting shot! The only problem is that the quality is really low - I can almost see the pixels in a few areas, namely  on the white hat. :( If it weren''t for that... but this is one awesome image - keep trying!!</td>', 'I love how there are simple tones contrasted against vibrant colors - it''s a really unique and interesting shot! The only problem is that the quality is really low - I can almost see the pixels in a few areas, namely  on the white hat. :( If it weren''t for that... but this is one awesome image - keep trying!!', '2007-05-07 13:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624472, 501980, 63269, '<td valign="top">Completely awesome. Totally surreal! I love the extreme, sharp details in the rock and the flowers, and how everything just sort of fades into misty fuzziness. A phenomenal image!</td>', 'Completely awesome. Totally surreal! I love the extreme, sharp details in the rock and the flowers, and how everything just sort of fades into misty fuzziness. A phenomenal image!', '2007-05-07 13:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624473, 504789, 15574, '<td valign="top">I love this! Nice cold gritty feeling. I just wish the man stood out a little more, all the dirt makes him blend in a little bit and takes away his facial expression, but no biggie. 9</td>', 'I love this! Nice cold gritty feeling. I just wish the man stood out a little more, all the dirt makes him blend in a little bit and takes away his facial expression, but no biggie. 9', '2007-05-07 13:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624476, 492291, 63269, '<td valign="top">Neat image - amazing composition!</td>', 'Neat image - amazing composition!', '2007-05-07 13:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624479, 505745, 63269, '<td valign="top">Good shot, Ilove how everything is kind of color-less except for the bright car. :)</td>', 'Good shot, Ilove how everything is kind of color-less except for the bright car. :)', '2007-05-07 13:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624481, 504937, 63269, '<td valign="top">Neat use of sepia - I like this!</td>', 'Neat use of sepia - I like this!', '2007-05-07 13:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624483, 494785, 63269, '<td valign="top">Fantastic details!  Good capture.</td>', 'Fantastic details!  Good capture.', '2007-05-07 13:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624487, 497017, 15574, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and DOF, the shadows are perfect but maybe some highlights on the hands would help because the overall image feels a little too dark. 7</td>', 'Nice colors and DOF, the shadows are perfect but maybe some highlights on the hands would help because the overall image feels a little too dark. 7', '2007-05-07 13:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624492, 505674, 63269, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! You''ve captured this powerful sense of disaster and wild violence. It might be cool if there was a little big more red in the flames, instead of just red... but i also like it just as it is. Excellent!</td>', 'Fantastic! You''ve captured this powerful sense of disaster and wild violence. It might be cool if there was a little big more red in the flames, instead of just red... but i also like it just as it is. Excellent!', '2007-05-07 13:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624495, 504853, 63269, '<td valign="top">Really cool POV - I love how you didn''t just shoot it straight on.  Neat texture study, and good shot.</td>', 'Really cool POV - I love how you didn''t just shoot it straight on.  Neat texture study, and good shot.', '2007-05-07 13:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624497, 493654, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love the violent colors - great shot.</td>', 'I love the violent colors - great shot.', '2007-05-07 13:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624501, 502997, 63269, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of sepia and burning. GOod job.</td>', 'Excellent use of sepia and burning. GOod job.', '2007-05-07 13:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624506, 504399, 15574, '<td valign="top">The DOF really brings out the already great sharpness of the flower. Perfect tones as well.</td>', 'The DOF really brings out the already great sharpness of the flower. Perfect tones as well.', '2007-05-07 13:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624508, 493668, 63269, '<td valign="top">Cool shot! I almost wish there was a little more contrast on the ground... but excellent job anyway.</td>', 'Cool shot! I almost wish there was a little more contrast on the ground... but excellent job anyway.', '2007-05-07 13:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624510, 494447, 63269, '<td valign="top">Awesome post-editing, I really like the vibrant contrasts here!</td>', 'Awesome post-editing, I really like the vibrant contrasts here!', '2007-05-07 13:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624511, 505171, 63269, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and lighting!</td>', 'Nice colors and lighting!', '2007-05-07 13:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624514, 503100, 63269, '<td valign="top">Awesome lighting, and glorious colors!</td>', 'Awesome lighting, and glorious colors!', '2007-05-07 13:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624520, 503282, 15574, '<td valign="top">WOW, this practically jumps off the screen. Very nice. I really like the light tobacco tone, it really adds to the feel.</td>', 'WOW, this practically jumps off the screen. Very nice. I really like the light tobacco tone, it really adds to the feel.', '2007-05-07 13:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624524, 505603, 15574, '<td valign="top">Great STL shot ;-)</td>', 'Great STL shot ;-)', '2007-05-07 13:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624544, 505388, 15574, '<td valign="top">Tells an emotional story in two pics, nice. Love the gritty feel.</td>', 'Tells an emotional story in two pics, nice. Love the gritty feel.', '2007-05-07 13:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624553, 497038, 15574, '<td valign="top">Fantasic detail.</td>', 'Fantasic detail.', '2007-05-07 13:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624558, 503876, 15574, '<td valign="top">Cute portrait, although I''m not exactly sure if she''s playing with her hair or playing the air guitar.</td>', 'Cute portrait, although I''m not exactly sure if she''s playing with her hair or playing the air guitar.', '2007-05-07 13:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624563, 504237, 36382, '<td valign="top">I think this is just about perfect.  The light is wonderful and soft, and the composition, with its zig-zagging lines, leads my eye into all the corners of the picture.</td>', 'I think this is just about perfect.  The light is wonderful and soft, and the composition, with its zig-zagging lines, leads my eye into all the corners of the picture.', '2007-05-07 13:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624578, 505595, 77819, '<td valign="top">Like the setup with the chair, it''s definately different.</td>', 'Like the setup with the chair, it''s definately different.', '2007-05-07 13:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624586, 505438, 77819, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, it looks better with a person in it.</td>', 'I like the shot, it looks better with a person in it.', '2007-05-07 13:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624738, 505525, 67152, '<td valign="top">i like the locale and the composition, but it really seems subdued lighting - as if a much longer exposure would have worked better - but would have resulted in probably more motion of the cars than you were looking for</td>', 'i like the locale and the composition, but it really seems subdued lighting - as if a much longer exposure would have worked better - but would have resulted in probably more motion of the cars than you were looking for', '2007-05-07 14:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624815, 505279, 29011, '<td valign="top">An eye pleasing shot with nice contrast and colors. Only pitty so many of the lines are jagged, might want to tweak the resizing and sharpening steps. And would''ve liked to see that horizontal line near the bottom right, cloned out.</td>', 'An eye pleasing shot with nice contrast and colors. Only pitty so many of the lines are jagged, might want to tweak the resizing and sharpening steps. And would''ve liked to see that horizontal line near the bottom right, cloned out.', '2007-05-07 15:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624830, 505658, 29011, '<td valign="top">Very nice closeup. Would perhaps dodge the eyes just a bit, so they don''t blend in as much with the black eye patch and add a touch of extra contrast.</td>', 'Very nice closeup. Would perhaps dodge the eyes just a bit, so they don''t blend in as much with the black eye patch and add a touch of extra contrast.', '2007-05-07 15:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624839, 501579, 29011, '<td valign="top">This is a dreamy shot. I like your post processing which includes the toning. Only nitpick it that one really bright area. Was it an effect of PP or overexposure?</td>', 'This is a dreamy shot. I like your post processing which includes the toning. Only nitpick it that one really bright area. Was it an effect of PP or overexposure?', '2007-05-07 15:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624840, 504213, 15574, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, looks great in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Nice portrait, looks great in B&W.', '2007-05-07 15:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624851, 501825, 29011, '<td valign="top">Cute captures :)  For the Free Study though, I''d probably just post the top one. It''s very strong on it''s own.</td>', 'Cute captures :)  For the Free Study though, I''d probably just post the top one. It''s very strong on it''s own.', '2007-05-07 15:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624881, 499072, 29011, '<td valign="top">Interesting treatment, which does work quite well here. Would only suggest that perhaps this would work better in b/w.</td>', 'Interesting treatment, which does work quite well here. Would only suggest that perhaps this would work better in b/w.', '2007-05-07 15:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624885, 504864, 29011, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! but the eyes look too oversatured for me. The mask itself looks great.</td>', 'Nice shot! but the eyes look too oversatured for me. The mask itself looks great.', '2007-05-07 15:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624890, 505575, 59415, '<td valign="top">This is od and distrubing.  Looks nice.</td>', 'This is od and distrubing.  Looks nice.', '2007-05-07 15:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624892, 504741, 29011, '<td valign="top">Good composition but the photo looks a little washed out, lacking some needed contrast/brightness tweaks. Otherwise it''s really nicely taken.</td>', 'Good composition but the photo looks a little washed out, lacking some needed contrast/brightness tweaks. Otherwise it''s really nicely taken.', '2007-05-07 15:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624896, 504785, 29011, '<td valign="top">A good simple portrait. I do find the butterfly distracting and out of place.</td>', 'A good simple portrait. I do find the butterfly distracting and out of place.', '2007-05-07 15:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624957, 501554, 41794, '<td valign="top">So very calm and peaceful. I love the rich warm tones that carry over from the sky into the water and then the rocks. Very beautiful and calming.</td>', 'So very calm and peaceful. I love the rich warm tones that carry over from the sky into the water and then the rocks. Very beautiful and calming.', '2007-05-07 16:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624974, 502900, 41794, '<td valign="top">I can totally "feel" the motion of this shot! Amazing!</td>', 'I can totally "feel" the motion of this shot! Amazing!', '2007-05-07 16:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3625004, 505120, 66384, '<td valign="top">That does look exactly like what I imagine Bilbo''s front door to look like. Strange that there''s no window at all around this entrance. The colors are very rich and the textures are good. Nice contrast. The vignette gives it a night look, but the carriage lamps are not turned on. It might be nice to add a little glow to them. 8</td>', 'That does look exactly like what I imagine Bilbo''s front door to look like. Strange that there''s no window at all around this entrance. The colors are very rich and the textures are good. Nice contrast. The vignette gives it a night look, but the carriage lamps are not turned on. It might be nice to add a little glow to them. 8', '2007-05-07 16:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3625012, 502564, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice processing. One little nit -- I''d remove he jet trail.</td>', 'Nice processing. One little nit -- I''d remove he jet trail.', '2007-05-07 16:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3625023, 494497, 42495, '<td valign="top">Great landscape, and it''s good to see one that''s not oversaturated and looks realistic.</td>', 'Great landscape, and it''s good to see one that''s not oversaturated and looks realistic.', '2007-05-07 16:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3625043, 505057, 42495, '<td valign="top">This is just awesome - great creativity and execution.</td>', 'This is just awesome - great creativity and execution.', '2007-05-07 16:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3625052, 505620, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, comp and clarity.</td>', 'Great lighting, comp and clarity.', '2007-05-07 16:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3625055, 500814, 59415, '<td valign="top">I think there should be one more o in there.</td>', 'I think there should be one more o in there.', '2007-05-07 16:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3625063, 500041, 33672, '<td valign="top">Worthy of expert editing. Emotive...yes. Defininitely art.10</td>', 'Worthy of expert editing. Emotive...yes. Defininitely art.10', '2007-05-07 16:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3625069, 501944, 33672, '<td valign="top">Creative. I really like the effect.</td>', 'Creative. I really like the effect.', '2007-05-07 16:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3625080, 504792, 42495, '<td valign="top">You''ve done an amazing job here capturing the motion of the water.  This picture looks alive and 3 dimensional.  Well done.</td>', 'You''ve done an amazing job here capturing the motion of the water.  This picture looks alive and 3 dimensional.  Well done.', '2007-05-07 16:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3625084, 505542, 59415, '<td valign="top">That is diffrent.</td>', 'That is diffrent.', '2007-05-07 16:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3625093, 505390, 66384, '<td valign="top">A little to orange on my monitor, but very nice composition.</td>', 'A little to orange on my monitor, but very nice composition.', '2007-05-07 16:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3625108, 503750, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and textures.</td>', 'Nice colors and textures.', '2007-05-07 16:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3625127, 495238, 66384, '<td valign="top">I think it would help if a little of the bottom were cropped off. Otherwise I like it.</td>', 'I think it would help if a little of the bottom were cropped off. Otherwise I like it.', '2007-05-07 16:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3625155, 504127, 50641, '<td valign="top">I like the harsh light and interesting shadows, but without more context, the jut of her ribcage looks kinda weird.  Actually, I might have preferred this as a closer crop on her face and arms (or even  just below the boob), since she has such a complex and interesting expression. Nice b/w tones.</td>', 'I like the harsh light and interesting shadows, but without more context, the jut of her ribcage looks kinda weird.  Actually, I might have preferred this as a closer crop on her face and arms (or even  just below the boob), since she has such a complex and interesting expression. Nice b/w tones.', '2007-05-07 17:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3625158, 505712, 50641, '<td valign="top">boy is this ever out of the box ;-)</td>', 'boy is this ever out of the box ;-)', '2007-05-07 17:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3625180, 493643, 50641, '<td valign="top">I love the crop, the colors and the idea.  Well done.</td>', 'I love the crop, the colors and the idea.  Well done.', '2007-05-07 17:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3625191, 496371, 50641, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Barbed wire, an old boat, a rocky seacoast, and a sunset!  This has got to be DPC heaven!</td>', 'Wow.  Barbed wire, an old boat, a rocky seacoast, and a sunset!  This has got to be DPC heaven!', '2007-05-07 17:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3625200, 501778, 50641, '<td valign="top">me too....now...    (puts down bag of chips...)  Nice shoppin''!!</td>', 'me too....now...    (puts down bag of chips...)  Nice shoppin''!!', '2007-05-07 17:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3625202, 504057, 50641, '<td valign="top">nice indigo!</td>', 'nice indigo!', '2007-05-07 17:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3625208, 505595, 50641, '<td valign="top">Cool!  It''s Buffy the Vampire Slayer!  (that''s a compliment ;-)<br/> <br/>I like the tilt and the pose and the smirk.</td>', 'Cool!  It''s Buffy the Vampire Slayer!  (that''s a compliment ;-) I like the tilt and the pose and the smirk.', '2007-05-07 17:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3625209, 502759, 15574, '<td valign="top">Haha, cute dog.</td>', 'Haha, cute dog.', '2007-05-07 17:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3625213, 503499, 50641, '<td valign="top">funky and demented (the idea, not the child).   nice twist!</td>', 'funky and demented (the idea, not the child).   nice twist!', '2007-05-07 17:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3625216, 503447, 43156, '<td valign="top">I dont if it was intentional but alien on the t-shirt; bats on the background and scary face of a child are all play good together. 8</td>', 'I dont if it was intentional but alien on the t-shirt; bats on the background and scary face of a child are all play good together. 8', '2007-05-07 17:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
