(3625901, 505652, 8860, '<td valign="top">Thanks to the unwelcome expert eding rules, it''s now impossible to assume that this is one capture. Shame really because the respect due for your work on this could be much greater if I was privy to that knowledge. <br/> <br/>I''ll assume it is not a comp and vote accordingly as I feel that to achieve a shot like this is worth a good score even if if the image doesn''t fit the aesthetic that most DPCers prefer.</td>', 'Thanks to the unwelcome expert eding rules, it''s now impossible to assume that this is one capture. Shame really because the respect due for your work on this could be much greater if I was privy to that knowledge.  I''ll assume it is not a comp and vote accordingly as I feel that to achieve a shot like this is worth a good score even if if the image doesn''t fit the aesthetic that most DPCers prefer.', '2007-05-07 20:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
