(3625978, 495051, 8860, '<td valign="top">The moody, over-dramatised treatment here belies a benign subject for me. The landscape is still interesting but lacks a focal point and it appears oddly bleached in places.</td>', 'The moody, over-dramatised treatment here belies a benign subject for me. The landscape is still interesting but lacks a focal point and it appears oddly bleached in places.', '2007-05-07 20:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3625992, 504237, 8860, '<td valign="top">Strong image - I just wish the edited contrast of the trees was consistent down their length.</td>', 'Strong image - I just wish the edited contrast of the trees was consistent down their length.', '2007-05-07 20:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3626037, 503876, 29011, '<td valign="top">An easy 10! from me :)  <br/>Digital art and photography cant get any better than this. The whole color scheme works wonderfully.</td>', 'An easy 10! from me :)  Digital art and photography cant get any better than this. The whole color scheme works wonderfully.', '2007-05-07 21:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3626042, 503925, 29011, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking shot. The contrast works so well with the black background. The shot of the subject is excellent, with the mane and beard ;) in the wind. There''s some drool in too hehe. 10!!</td>', 'Breathtaking shot. The contrast works so well with the black background. The shot of the subject is excellent, with the mane and beard ;) in the wind. There''s some drool in too hehe. 10!!', '2007-05-07 21:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3626048, 505564, 61651, '<td valign="top">I want to give this technique a try myself, but haven''t yet got around to it.  Nicely done - how on earth did you take such a shot and not have captured any people in it?  If they''re there I haven''t spotted them yet, or maybe you cloned them out. :)</td>', 'I want to give this technique a try myself, but haven''t yet got around to it.  Nicely done - how on earth did you take such a shot and not have captured any people in it?  If they''re there I haven''t spotted them yet, or maybe you cloned them out. :)', '2007-05-07 21:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
