(3626459, 501385, 60805, '<td valign="top">Is that a prado - landcruiser. Lot of those in my country. This looks like a commercial shot. HDR is''nt it. Well enuff of that. I like it alot although i wish the vehicle was alot closer at the same exact angle. Then u''ld get the sunset peeping over the roof. ok 8</td>', 'Is that a prado - landcruiser. Lot of those in my country. This looks like a commercial shot. HDR is''nt it. Well enuff of that. I like it alot although i wish the vehicle was alot closer at the same exact angle. Then u''ld get the sunset peeping over the roof. ok 8', '2007-05-07 22:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3626465, 505622, 50641, '<td valign="top">I''m digging this, except for the area behind the standing you - where the mask looks kind of jaggy.  But ultimately, very interesting and arty and effective.</td>', 'I''m digging this, except for the area behind the standing you - where the mask looks kind of jaggy.  But ultimately, very interesting and arty and effective.', '2007-05-07 22:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
