(3626545, 505698, 50695, '<td valign="top">I find this quite funny. The bride seems tired but still more aggressive than the husband. In photos like this, symbols carry a lot of weight, so the fact that her bouquet is pointing down means a lot. I''m giving this a 10 because it is both funny and genuine.</td>', 'I find this quite funny. The bride seems tired but still more aggressive than the husband. In photos like this, symbols carry a lot of weight, so the fact that her bouquet is pointing down means a lot. I''m giving this a 10 because it is both funny and genuine.', '2007-05-07 23:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
