(3626594, 502759, 5347, '<td valign="top">The editing is very smeared.  It starts to look like a pastel on the dogs face and chest, but then the blurred areas in the foreground and smeared lines at the back look bad, sorry.  Just trying to be honest.</td>', 'The editing is very smeared.  It starts to look like a pastel on the dogs face and chest, but then the blurred areas in the foreground and smeared lines at the back look bad, sorry.  Just trying to be honest.', '2007-05-07 23:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
