(3627159, 497999, 60862, '<td valign="top">Heh.  Your comments sum things up pretty well.  Posthumous is the anti-indicator.  If he loves your shot, put that in the bank and know your score won''t be high. However, it means you took a chance on something that didn''t fit the typical mold.  I speak from personal experience in this exact challenge. :)<br/> <br/>Anyway, I like your shot.  Good for you for entering it!</td>', 'Heh.  Your comments sum things up pretty well.  Posthumous is the anti-indicator.  If he loves your shot, put that in the bank and know your score won''t be high. However, it means you took a chance on something that didn''t fit the typical mold.  I speak from personal experience in this exact challenge. :) Anyway, I like your shot.  Good for you for entering it!', '2007-05-08 01:15:20.000000', NULL, 0),
