(3627236, 500041, 36999, '<td valign="top">Judi, this one has taken photography well into the realm of illustration.  As far as I''m concered I think it''s a brilliant example of a vision very well executed.  You deserve lots of kudos for being able to create such a piece and I hope that those that don''t care for expert editing in DPC can at least appreciate the skill, time and initial ideas required to make such a vision come to be.  Bravo.</td>', 'Judi, this one has taken photography well into the realm of illustration.  As far as I''m concered I think it''s a brilliant example of a vision very well executed.  You deserve lots of kudos for being able to create such a piece and I hope that those that don''t care for expert editing in DPC can at least appreciate the skill, time and initial ideas required to make such a vision come to be.  Bravo.', '2007-05-08 01:32:07.000000', NULL, 0),
