(3627294, 505659, 60862, '<td valign="top">Hmm.  I like the 3-view and the juxtaposition with the modern airplane very much (I''m a private pilot).  I''m not sure how skewsme fits in.  I wonder if it''d work better with symbolic people, too, like skewsme under the 3-view and a stick figure under the modern plane?<br/> <br/>Either way, this is a composition that would benefit greatly from hanging on a wall with a plaque next to it.  DPC just isn''t set up for deep contemplation and reflection on challenge entries.</td>', 'Hmm.  I like the 3-view and the juxtaposition with the modern airplane very much (I''m a private pilot).  I''m not sure how skewsme fits in.  I wonder if it''d work better with symbolic people, too, like skewsme under the 3-view and a stick figure under the modern plane? Either way, this is a composition that would benefit greatly from hanging on a wall with a plaque next to it.  DPC just isn''t set up for deep contemplation and reflection on challenge entries.', '2007-05-08 01:47:08.000000', NULL, 0),
