(3627407, 493752, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait and the colors are superb. I also like how her face is the brightest. I do however think that placement of the hands could be better as her left hand blocks a good part of her lips and seems a bit awkward, and the right shows the back of her hand. Still, an exceptional image. Congratulations on your first ribbon!</td>', 'Beautiful portrait and the colors are superb. I also like how her face is the brightest. I do however think that placement of the hands could be better as her left hand blocks a good part of her lips and seems a bit awkward, and the right shows the back of her hand. Still, an exceptional image. Congratulations on your first ribbon!', '2007-05-08 02:23:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(3627412, 504577, 53814, '<td valign="top">This shot should be hanging on the wall next to the hopper shot. Great job. since this was expert editing, I would have used transform -&gt; perspective to line up the photo parallel with the bottom of your photo, but that is a minor technical point.</td>', 'This shot should be hanging on the wall next to the hopper shot. Great job. since this was expert editing, I would have used transform -> perspective to line up the photo parallel with the bottom of your photo, but that is a minor technical point.', '2007-05-08 02:26:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3627413, 493752, 39110, '<td valign="top">My only 10, very happy to see it win blue ribbon congratulations :)</td>', 'My only 10, very happy to see it win blue ribbon congratulations :)', '2007-05-08 02:27:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3627423, 493752, 36999, '<td valign="top">congrats on the blue!  This is gorgeous!</td>', 'congrats on the blue!  This is gorgeous!', '2007-05-08 02:33:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3627433, 502900, 17446, '<td valign="top">Thank you, everyone, for your comments.  They were all very encouraging.  I''m extremely excited about how well received this photo turned out to be.<br/>No expert editing was used.  I simply adjusted levels, ran neat image, then sharpened.  I took a lot of shots that day, but this stood out because of the focus down the road with the sides blurred.  It looks much nicer as a print than on a moniter.</td>', 'Thank you, everyone, for your comments.  They were all very encouraging.  I''m extremely excited about how well received this photo turned out to be.No expert editing was used.  I simply adjusted levels, ran neat image, then sharpened.  I took a lot of shots that day, but this stood out because of the focus down the road with the sides blurred.  It looks much nicer as a print than on a moniter.', '2007-05-08 02:41:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(3627438, 503282, 7786, '<td valign="top">Congrats with the 2nd place. Another great image from you. How do you do it, and why hasn´t any team invited you yet on DPL?</td>', 'Congrats with the 2nd place. Another great image from you. How do you do it, and why hasn´t any team invited you yet on DPL?', '2007-05-08 02:42:48.000000', NULL, 0),
