(3627500, 504565, 57936, '<td valign="top">Composition is weak. The trees at the bottom distract from the main point of the image. The pigeons and weather vane are too centered in the image. Some judicious cropping would solve both of these problems. The bird to the right of the frame is nicely captured, the one on the left is a bit indistinct. The black and white presentation is nice, but it might be better with a bit of levels adjustment to give more life to the image.</td>', 'Composition is weak. The trees at the bottom distract from the main point of the image. The pigeons and weather vane are too centered in the image. Some judicious cropping would solve both of these problems. The bird to the right of the frame is nicely captured, the one on the left is a bit indistinct. The black and white presentation is nice, but it might be better with a bit of levels adjustment to give more life to the image.', '2007-05-08 03:36:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3627504, 505169, 57936, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by danthesquidkid:</b></div><hr/><i> just a shutterfly photo. use a bit of editing </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Uhhhh, did you notice that the players in the picture are the same individual? How much editing do you want? LOL!</td>', 'Originally posted by danthesquidkid: just a shutterfly photo. use a bit of editing  Uhhhh, did you notice that the players in the picture are the same individual? How much editing do you want? LOL!', '2007-05-08 03:39:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3627514, 504434, 39184, '<td valign="top">You JUST edged me out of 12th.  Again, I admire your patience in waiting for that shot.  While everybody else was jostling around the crowds trying to get the perfect picture, you just stood by your tripod waiting and waiting.  And it paid off.  Congratulations!</td>', 'You JUST edged me out of 12th.  Again, I admire your patience in waiting for that shot.  While everybody else was jostling around the crowds trying to get the perfect picture, you just stood by your tripod waiting and waiting.  And it paid off.  Congratulations!', '2007-05-08 03:46:39.000000', NULL, 0),
