(3627526, 503464, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m very impressed with the editing to do the makeup!  Had you not said it was editing, I''d never have known.  It has a peaceful feel to it to me.  And I gotta say, shooting at 2 seconds, hand held, you did a GREAT job getting a crisp shot!</td>', 'I''m very impressed with the editing to do the makeup!  Had you not said it was editing, I''d never have known.  It has a peaceful feel to it to me.  And I gotta say, shooting at 2 seconds, hand held, you did a GREAT job getting a crisp shot!', '2007-05-08 03:53:19.000000', NULL, 0),
