(3627537, 502267, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great capture, Steve!  I really don''t understand "busy background is distracting" comments when one is shooting not set-up shots, but maybe that''s just me.  And I like the background - puts it all into context and adds interest.  Wonderful focus on the bee and very nice editing - I''ll have to look up those filters.</td>', 'Great capture, Steve!  I really don''t understand "busy background is distracting" comments when one is shooting not set-up shots, but maybe that''s just me.  And I like the background - puts it all into context and adds interest.  Wonderful focus on the bee and very nice editing - I''ll have to look up those filters.', '2007-05-08 03:58:43.000000', NULL, 0),
