(3627785, 503464, 66597, '<td valign="top">Kelly, I gave you a 7, which means that I really, really like it. I find it both creative and interesting. You got hurt, most likely, by the small shadow behind the head - the intersection between the hair and the background needs a little touch-up - it doesn''t quite look natural. Still, I like this a lot!</td>', 'Kelly, I gave you a 7, which means that I really, really like it. I find it both creative and interesting. You got hurt, most likely, by the small shadow behind the head - the intersection between the hair and the background needs a little touch-up - it doesn''t quite look natural. Still, I like this a lot!', '2007-05-08 08:42:00.000000', NULL, 0),
