(3627991, 505022, 68256, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone! Dewdodesign, the sky was as is - not added.  I did dodge and burn a little to boost the contrast in the clouds, but it is all natural...just some low hanging clouds that day.<br/> <br/>I thought it was funny that another photo in this challenge was titled with a country song..I think it was this challenge anyway....<br/> <br/>By the way, this is a self portrait and you should have seen me running to try and get on the tractor before the timer finished!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-05-08 09:26:25.</i></td>', 'Thanks everyone! Dewdodesign, the sky was as is - not added.  I did dodge and burn a little to boost the contrast in the clouds, but it is all natural...just some low hanging clouds that day. I thought it was funny that another photo in this challenge was titled with a country song..I think it was this challenge anyway.... By the way, this is a self portrait and you should have seen me running to try and get on the tractor before the timer finished!', '2007-05-08 10:22:58.000000', '2007-05-08 10:26:25.000000', 0),
