(3628349, 493636, 68256, '<td valign="top">I loved the simplicity of this and lighting.  Great job and I gave you an 8 during voting.  It is a very pleasing composition to me.  I might have cropped even closer on the left side to get rid of that last rail, but that is just me.....<br/> <br/></td>', 'I loved the simplicity of this and lighting.  Great job and I gave you an 8 during voting.  It is a very pleasing composition to me.  I might have cropped even closer on the left side to get rid of that last rail, but that is just me..... ', '2007-05-08 12:16:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3628352, 505219, 14476, '<td valign="top"><b>Greetings from the Critique Club</b> <br/> <br/>Isn''t it nice when you get a shot that, with minimal processing, can stand up to entries that took Expert Editing to the limits!<br/> <br/>This is a beauty, and doesn''t need much of a critique from me, except to reinforce the scoring.  Had I voted on this challenge my vote would have been right up there as well.<br/> <br/>Beautiful work - wish it was mine.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club  Isn''t it nice when you get a shot that, with minimal processing, can stand up to entries that took Expert Editing to the limits! This is a beauty, and doesn''t need much of a critique from me, except to reinforce the scoring.  Had I voted on this challenge my vote would have been right up there as well. Beautiful work - wish it was mine. ', '2007-05-08 12:17:26.000000', NULL, 0),
