(3628453, 503828, 52549, '<td valign="top">I''m glad this did so well for you, Lorrie. It''s just so beautiful and was one of my top scorers. Congrats on top 20.</td>', 'I''m glad this did so well for you, Lorrie. It''s just so beautiful and was one of my top scorers. Congrats on top 20.', '2007-05-08 12:32:21.000000', NULL, 0),
