(3628525, 500006, 5112, '<td valign="top">So this was yours, I wouldn''t have guessed :)  This is such a weird image in some ways, such a disconnect in a way between the top and bottom parts, and yet, so real.  Having lived in Wyoming for a long time, I sort of know things look pretty strange sometimes (most of the time) in the desert areas.  I really like this image, it''s real to me.</td>', 'So this was yours, I wouldn''t have guessed :)  This is such a weird image in some ways, such a disconnect in a way between the top and bottom parts, and yet, so real.  Having lived in Wyoming for a long time, I sort of know things look pretty strange sometimes (most of the time) in the desert areas.  I really like this image, it''s real to me.', '2007-05-08 12:49:34.000000', NULL, 0),
