(3628558, 503588, 37961, '<td valign="top">How sweet. It''s a shame our dogs don''t live a little longer. The relationship between a dog and his master is so special. I have had to say goodbye to several canine companions in my life time. But they wear out and we have to open our hearts to love a new friend. :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'How sweet. It''s a shame our dogs don''t live a little longer. The relationship between a dog and his master is so special. I have had to say goodbye to several canine companions in my life time. But they wear out and we have to open our hearts to love a new friend. :) ', '2007-05-08 12:58:03.000000', NULL, 0),
