(3629074, 504221, 66597, '<td valign="top">Hi Peter, I think you''ve been getting robbed lately. I was one of your 7''s, and I might have bumped it up had I gone back. I think this has a message, excellent DOF, and excellent composition. I suspect you got hurt by the very slightly blown areas on the sand - people are technical sticklers with this type of competition. Still think you got robbed on an excellent entry!</td>', 'Hi Peter, I think you''ve been getting robbed lately. I was one of your 7''s, and I might have bumped it up had I gone back. I think this has a message, excellent DOF, and excellent composition. I suspect you got hurt by the very slightly blown areas on the sand - people are technical sticklers with this type of competition. Still think you got robbed on an excellent entry!', '2007-05-08 15:20:56.000000', NULL, 0),
