(3629235, 504950, 50695, '<td valign="top">My reaction to this while voting was non-reaction. I gave it a 5. I think your description sums it up well. It is a not very exciting composition prettied up with color and obscured with a vignette. I almost never like vignetting, because it is so often used to attempt to compensate for a composition that''s not doing the job.<br/> <br/>But you scored a point and a half higher than I did in this challenge, so no worries. :)</td>', 'My reaction to this while voting was non-reaction. I gave it a 5. I think your description sums it up well. It is a not very exciting composition prettied up with color and obscured with a vignette. I almost never like vignetting, because it is so often used to attempt to compensate for a composition that''s not doing the job. But you scored a point and a half higher than I did in this challenge, so no worries. :)', '2007-05-08 16:19:15.000000', NULL, 0),
