(3629328, 505575, 53814, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mad_brewer:</b></div><hr/><i> the bit of feather on the ladder just makes it better. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Ken, thanks for recognizing the feather on the ladder. It took me longer to try and draw that one feather than it took me to do the whole rest of the composite.<br/> <br/>Thanks to everyone for the comments and suggestions.</td>', 'Originally posted by mad_brewer: the bit of feather on the ladder just makes it better.   Ken, thanks for recognizing the feather on the ladder. It took me longer to try and draw that one feather than it took me to do the whole rest of the composite. Thanks to everyone for the comments and suggestions.', '2007-05-08 16:52:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(3629333, 503828, 48227, '<td valign="top">Baby photos are my favorite category., this one is amazing and so good. Love everything about it. Adding to favorites.</td>', 'Baby photos are my favorite category., this one is amazing and so good. Love everything about it. Adding to favorites.', '2007-05-08 16:53:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3629336, 503641, 75898, '<td valign="top">Wow!  That''s pretty cool.  I didn''t vote on the free studies but I like this one.  Very unique idea...the only suggestions I''d make would be to make the two farthest guys a bit smaller and softer as if they were gradually receding into the distance.  IMO, not PP too much <i>at all</i>.  It''s obviously not a single exposure but you just combined a few photos in a fun way...no harm, no foul.  I like it.</td>', 'Wow!  That''s pretty cool.  I didn''t vote on the free studies but I like this one.  Very unique idea...the only suggestions I''d make would be to make the two farthest guys a bit smaller and softer as if they were gradually receding into the distance.  IMO, not PP too much at all.  It''s obviously not a single exposure but you just combined a few photos in a fun way...no harm, no foul.  I like it.', '2007-05-08 16:54:33.000000', NULL, 0),
