(3629356, 504557, 42792, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all the comments.  This was an experiment in using the multiple exposure parameter within my camera and I loved how the colours blended together.  The rest was just a case of cropping, levels and contrast adjustments with a subtle texture filter.</td>', 'Thank you for all the comments.  This was an experiment in using the multiple exposure parameter within my camera and I loved how the colours blended together.  The rest was just a case of cropping, levels and contrast adjustments with a subtle texture filter.', '2007-05-08 17:00:59.000000', NULL, 0),
