(3629515, 505217, 23484, '<td valign="top">Yes, this is definitely an oasis. You''re right about the little things that nobody notices.  Neat idea.</td>', 'Yes, this is definitely an oasis. You''re right about the little things that nobody notices.  Neat idea.', '2007-05-08 17:54:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(3629520, 505659, 61651, '<td valign="top">I thought "Close Encounters" when I first saw it, the symbols on the left looking like some sort of alien hieroglyphics.  Did not know about the Wright Flyer three-view before - I like how you tried to approximate a bird with the three-view and the dramatic sky gives the whole image a portentous quality.  <br/> <br/>It would be interesting to see another try at this shot without the plane, and with the three views placed randomly across the whole expanse of the sky (well, it might be *visually* interesting, but conceptually not so much - since I guess the inclusion of the plane was necessary for the Wright brothers connection).  Nevermind, I''m babbling about possibilities again. :)</td>', 'I thought "Close Encounters" when I first saw it, the symbols on the left looking like some sort of alien hieroglyphics.  Did not know about the Wright Flyer three-view before - I like how you tried to approximate a bird with the three-view and the dramatic sky gives the whole image a portentous quality.   It would be interesting to see another try at this shot without the plane, and with the three views placed randomly across the whole expanse of the sky (well, it might be *visually* interesting, but conceptually not so much - since I guess the inclusion of the plane was necessary for the Wright brothers connection).  Nevermind, I''m babbling about possibilities again. :)', '2007-05-08 17:55:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3629541, 505471, 61651, '<td valign="top">Not a bad looking place to have to be when you''re not at home!  Nice mystery in the darker parts and the overall coloring has a nostalgic quality to it, although I''ll admit I would prefer the backpack were not there - too distracting. <br/> <br/>And I really like the inclusion of motion blur for the human part of this shot - for me, it emphasizes the ephemeral quality of human life just "passing through" these solid examples of classic architecture.</td>', 'Not a bad looking place to have to be when you''re not at home!  Nice mystery in the darker parts and the overall coloring has a nostalgic quality to it, although I''ll admit I would prefer the backpack were not there - too distracting.  And I really like the inclusion of motion blur for the human part of this shot - for me, it emphasizes the ephemeral quality of human life just "passing through" these solid examples of classic architecture.', '2007-05-08 18:01:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3629545, 505545, 61651, '<td valign="top">You know, I thought of that stove pic when I saw this and thought this might be you.  Love the colors here and the light.</td>', 'You know, I thought of that stove pic when I saw this and thought this might be you.  Love the colors here and the light.', '2007-05-08 18:03:58.000000', NULL, 0),
