(3629558, 504195, 24962, '<td valign="top">I liked this a lot, wildlife is one of my favourite subjects. In fact, I am taking my camera to work tomorrow (Wednesday) cos we have lots of new babies. Last count was three, four and six Canada Geese Goslings, one Coot and a persistent Heron. There are a pair of Egyptian Geese, but they have never bred here yet.<br/> <br/>Well done, Deb, and keep enjoying what you do!!</td>', 'I liked this a lot, wildlife is one of my favourite subjects. In fact, I am taking my camera to work tomorrow (Wednesday) cos we have lots of new babies. Last count was three, four and six Canada Geese Goslings, one Coot and a persistent Heron. There are a pair of Egyptian Geese, but they have never bred here yet. Well done, Deb, and keep enjoying what you do!!', '2007-05-08 18:07:23.000000', NULL, 0),
