(3633366, 499192, 65886, '<td valign="top">I think it can look <b>fantastic</b> in b&amp;w!<br/>absolutely wonderful composition, with the lines and the lamps "breaking" the straight lines.<br/>I also wonderful how the same place would look like in vertical frame? though the horisontal one helps the sea lines to stand out.<br/>I really love the centered comp here, very well balanced picture.</td>', 'I think it can look fantastic in b&w!absolutely wonderful composition, with the lines and the lamps "breaking" the straight lines.I also wonderful how the same place would look like in vertical frame? though the horisontal one helps the sea lines to stand out.I really love the centered comp here, very well balanced picture.', '2007-05-09 13:38:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3633497, 499192, 62095, '<td valign="top">One of those odd shots where there is not too much to comment about.  Surprised it didn''t pick up a slightly higher score really.  Would have been fine for the symmetry challenge I expect or the vanishing point. You could even do a re-shoot in a moody night sky.</td>', 'One of those odd shots where there is not too much to comment about.  Surprised it didn''t pick up a slightly higher score really.  Would have been fine for the symmetry challenge I expect or the vanishing point. You could even do a re-shoot in a moody night sky.', '2007-05-09 14:10:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3633511, 503369, 45524, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique club. First off you met the challenge well because its a free study.<br/> <br/>Things I like about the photo I love the bright colors and the contrast and saturation seem just about right. I''m not so sure about the composition. I dont like the railing in the foreground. I would have def cropped or moved up so as to not have that in the frame. I also might have moved left or right so that the trees arent dead center of the frame. I''d have preferred them off to the left or right of the frame. Overall a pretty decent score from a nice shot. Good luck in future challenges.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique club. First off you met the challenge well because its a free study. Things I like about the photo I love the bright colors and the contrast and saturation seem just about right. I''m not so sure about the composition. I dont like the railing in the foreground. I would have def cropped or moved up so as to not have that in the frame. I also might have moved left or right so that the trees arent dead center of the frame. I''d have preferred them off to the left or right of the frame. Overall a pretty decent score from a nice shot. Good luck in future challenges. ', '2007-05-09 14:14:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3633528, 500060, 45524, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique club. First things first. I love the color of the bugs, they are fun little creatures. I''d liked to have seen a bit more DOF on this and crop the right side of the photo or move the composition before taking the photo, the piece on the right keeps drawing my attention away from the subject because part of it is as focused as the insects themselves. Overall not a bad score. Good luck in future challenges.<br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique club. First things first. I love the color of the bugs, they are fun little creatures. I''d liked to have seen a bit more DOF on this and crop the right side of the photo or move the composition before taking the photo, the piece on the right keeps drawing my attention away from the subject because part of it is as focused as the insects themselves. Overall not a bad score. Good luck in future challenges.', '2007-05-09 14:18:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3633540, 504950, 51538, '<td valign="top">I like the ethereal blue.  But I don''t much like the foreground vignette.  I''d have been more inclined to crop the photo or add a heavy bottom border to get rid of that space.</td>', 'I like the ethereal blue.  But I don''t much like the foreground vignette.  I''d have been more inclined to crop the photo or add a heavy bottom border to get rid of that space.', '2007-05-09 14:20:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3633543, 505205, 45524, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the critique club. First off let me tell you this is a well done shot and I''m kind of suprised it didnt score higher then it did. I''m not sure most people understand the difficulty of shooting this type of photo. I''m really not sure what I can tell you to improve the shot. However I will tell you that adding a simple border does help with the voters and I might suggest that you try that next time. Overall well done.</td>', 'Greetings from the critique club. First off let me tell you this is a well done shot and I''m kind of suprised it didnt score higher then it did. I''m not sure most people understand the difficulty of shooting this type of photo. I''m really not sure what I can tell you to improve the shot. However I will tell you that adding a simple border does help with the voters and I might suggest that you try that next time. Overall well done.', '2007-05-09 14:21:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(3633559, 505659, 62787, '<td valign="top">Heh, I like the creations in the sky. For whatever reason, it makes me think of Oddysey 2001 and big black monolyths (no, I don''t really understand why either...). The plane doesn''t quite fit into the picture somehow, I agree with krnodil''s comment.<br/> <br/>Oh, and I beat you - my Free Study entry sucks more than yours :p<br/></td>', 'Heh, I like the creations in the sky. For whatever reason, it makes me think of Oddysey 2001 and big black monolyths (no, I don''t really understand why either...). The plane doesn''t quite fit into the picture somehow, I agree with krnodil''s comment. Oh, and I beat you - my Free Study entry sucks more than yours :p', '2007-05-09 14:24:38.000000', NULL, 0),
