(3695894, 505074, 55838, '<td valign="top">Good ol'' lovely weeds!  If you were in my backyard you''d have to call this From Death Unto Life Unto Death Unto Life Life Life... I think we have more dandelions than grass!  Nice idea for this challenge.  Using a pic for the background is a really cool idea but I think I agree with those below that mention that it seems busy - but it''s hard to say without seeing what a solid color would look like.  Oops forgot - I voted 7.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-05-25 19:52:11.</i></td>', 'Good ol'' lovely weeds!  If you were in my backyard you''d have to call this From Death Unto Life Unto Death Unto Life Life Life... I think we have more dandelions than grass!  Nice idea for this challenge.  Using a pic for the background is a really cool idea but I think I agree with those below that mention that it seems busy - but it''s hard to say without seeing what a solid color would look like.  Oops forgot - I voted 7.', '2007-05-25 20:51:42.000000', '2007-05-25 20:52:11.000000', 0),
