(3716574, 504339, 68504, '<td valign="top">Must have been very limited DOF to get just the leaves in focus - the patterns are great, and the gloss is good;  the two out of focus blooms are lighted in a wonderfully similar way, and the rock background is great.  A slightly different crop might have made this work better, or a different angle to give a compositional punch.  (Never tired of photographing trilliums).</td>', 'Must have been very limited DOF to get just the leaves in focus - the patterns are great, and the gloss is good;  the two out of focus blooms are lighted in a wonderfully similar way, and the rock background is great.  A slightly different crop might have made this work better, or a different angle to give a compositional punch.  (Never tired of photographing trilliums).', '2007-05-30 17:59:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3719637, 503156, 56254, '<td valign="top">Great color saturation and nice focus on the butterfly ... the spiderweb in the lower left is distracting to my eye ... makes me think the image is scratched ... I''d try a tighter crop to eliminate the web along with the stems from the leaves ... both of those things compete for attention with that gorgeous butterfly ...</td>', 'Great color saturation and nice focus on the butterfly ... the spiderweb in the lower left is distracting to my eye ... makes me think the image is scratched ... I''d try a tighter crop to eliminate the web along with the stems from the leaves ... both of those things compete for attention with that gorgeous butterfly ...', '2007-05-31 15:22:51.000000', NULL, 0),
