(4051966, 499458, 69008, '<td valign="top">I feel that the lack of sharpness may have hurt this one in an expert editing challenge. I have found that it helps a lot to resize in 500 pixel steps, sharpening before the first and after the last step down in size. <br/>Beautiful scene and great colors. I would get up before dawn to go see it. It would be interesting to see more history about the vessel.<br/>A gradient neutral density can be used when shooting to help with the bright spot in the sky by slanting it with the dark part into the bright part of a scene like this. <br/>You may already know both tricks, but I wanted to share the info. Many of your images are just excellent. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-09-03 01:48:13.</i></td>', 'I feel that the lack of sharpness may have hurt this one in an expert editing challenge. I have found that it helps a lot to resize in 500 pixel steps, sharpening before the first and after the last step down in size. Beautiful scene and great colors. I would get up before dawn to go see it. It would be interesting to see more history about the vessel.A gradient neutral density can be used when shooting to help with the bright spot in the sky by slanting it with the dark part into the bright part of a scene like this. You may already know both tricks, but I wanted to share the info. Many of your images are just excellent. ', '2007-09-03 02:44:35.000000', '2007-09-03 02:48:13.000000', 0),
