(4063841, 493394, 60862, '<td valign="top">Ah, forget the voters.  This is a great study in contrasts, and it captures how the Eye just kind of looms over everything.  You have a nice riverside scene, but there''s this gigantic metal wheel hanging above you.  I get the same feeling about the Washington Monument here.    I also like the contrast between brightly lit, manufactured round shape of the Eye and the dark, clearly organic, random linear shapes of the trees.</td>', 'Ah, forget the voters.  This is a great study in contrasts, and it captures how the Eye just kind of looms over everything.  You have a nice riverside scene, but there''s this gigantic metal wheel hanging above you.  I get the same feeling about the Washington Monument here.    I also like the contrast between brightly lit, manufactured round shape of the Eye and the dark, clearly organic, random linear shapes of the trees.', '2007-09-06 00:32:17.000000', NULL, 0),
