(4610444, 501058, 24454, '<td valign="top">What an amazing photo!   I have tried so many times to get this "look" with certain photos, but I always fall short.  I just love the edginess. . .the rich processing.  The tones.  And the character.   <br/> <br/>** back to Photoshop to try again **  :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'What an amazing photo!   I have tried so many times to get this "look" with certain photos, but I always fall short.  I just love the edginess. . .the rich processing.  The tones.  And the character.    ** back to Photoshop to try again **  :) ', '2008-04-03 11:02:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4641213, 493871, 68586, '<td valign="top">Tim - I don''t know how I haven''t seen this before - Magnificent picture !!<br/> <br/>You see this is the reason that I go surfing through other peoples favourite shots - it turns up all sorts of things that they''ve noticed and I haven''t  :- )<br/> <br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-04-15 16:05:46.</i></td>', 'Tim - I don''t know how I haven''t seen this before - Magnificent picture !! You see this is the reason that I go surfing through other peoples favourite shots - it turns up all sorts of things that they''ve noticed and I haven''t  :- ) ', '2008-04-15 17:04:06.000000', '2008-04-15 17:05:46.000000', 0),
