(4711283, 498207, 30049, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by JDubsgirl:</b></div><hr/><i> wow, the guy leading the horse into the water is really cool, that would be an excellent photo by itself. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>You mean like this?  :-)<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=509510" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30049/120/509510.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30049/120/509510.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30049/120/509510.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Originally posted by JDubsgirl: wow, the guy leading the horse into the water is really cool, that would be an excellent photo by itself.  You mean like this?  :-) ', '2008-05-19 12:27:52.000000', NULL, 0),
