(4790362, 501691, 72579, '<td valign="top">THAT''S ME!!!!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'THAT''S ME!!!!!!!!!!!!', '2008-06-29 19:41:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4872108, 502856, 30982, '<td valign="top">Here I was thinking this was one heckuva find.  Wondered how that got there.  Then I read "expert editing" - a ha!  It''s a composite!  A very well done one, too.  Great tones, and indeed expertly edited.  Then I looked at other comments - people commenting on the border.  So I had to go back and LOOK at this offensive border... apparently I must not mind because it didn''t bother me at all.  In fact, it suits the shot quite well!</td>', 'Here I was thinking this was one heckuva find.  Wondered how that got there.  Then I read "expert editing" - a ha!  It''s a composite!  A very well done one, too.  Great tones, and indeed expertly edited.  Then I looked at other comments - people commenting on the border.  So I had to go back and LOOK at this offensive border... apparently I must not mind because it didn''t bother me at all.  In fact, it suits the shot quite well!', '2008-08-07 05:19:50.000000', NULL, 0),
