(5414414, 493752, 77521, '<td valign="top">i just have to say that this was the first portrait that i saw on DPC a year or two ago that really made my jaw drop! i had no idea then, how to create an image as stunning as this one. i can say i''ve gotten a little closer but none of my portraits compare to this. amazing image, congrats on such a great portrait.</td>', 'i just have to say that this was the first portrait that i saw on DPC a year or two ago that really made my jaw drop! i had no idea then, how to create an image as stunning as this one. i can say i''ve gotten a little closer but none of my portraits compare to this. amazing image, congrats on such a great portrait.', '2009-04-02 02:49:19.000000', NULL, 0),
